#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:412
msgid "G-code thumbnails"
msgstr "G-code 縮圖"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:414
msgid ""
"Picture sizes to be stored into a .gcode / .bgcode file, in the following "
"format: \"XxY/EXT, XxY/EXT, ...\"\n"
"Currently supported extensions are PNG, QOI, JPG, BTT_TFT and COLPIC."
msgstr ""
"要儲存至 .gcode / .bgcode 檔案的圖片尺寸，格式如下：\"XxY/EXT, XxY/EXT, ..."
"\"\n"
"目前支援的副檔名為 PNG、QOI、JPG、BTT_TFT 及 COLPIC。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:421
msgid "Format of G-code thumbnails"
msgstr "G-code 縮圖的格式"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:423
msgid ""
"Format of G-code thumbnails: PNG for best quality, JPG for smallest size, "
"QOI for low memory firmware, BTT_TFT for BigTreeTech touchscreens, COLPIC "
"for Elegoo Neptune-series on-screen previews"
msgstr ""
"G-code 縮圖格式：PNG 品質最佳，JPG 體積最小，QOI 適用於低記憶體韌體，BTT_TFT "
"適用於 BigTreeTech 觸控螢幕，COLPIC 適用於 Elegoo Neptune 系列的螢幕預覽"

