msgid "Minimum travel feedrate"
msgstr "移動時的最小進給率"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:2904
msgid "Minimum travel feedrate (M205 T)"
msgstr "移動時的最小進給率 (M205 T)"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:2912
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1035
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1036
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1226
msgid "Junction deviation"
msgstr "接點偏差"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:2914
msgid ""
"Junction deviation for Marlin 2.x firmware (M205 J).\n"
"\n"
"When set to a value greater than 0, the slicer will use the junction "
"deviation algorithm instead of classic jerk for time estimation and will "
"output M205 J in the G-code.\n"
"\n"
"Junction deviation provides more accurate cornering speed calculations by "
"allowing the toolhead to deviate from the ideal path by this distance at "
"corners.\n"
"\n"
"Typical values: 0.01 - 0.08 mm\n"
"Set to 0 to use classic jerk (M205 XYZE)."
msgstr ""
"Marlin 2.x 韌體的接點偏差（M205 J）。\n"
"\n"
"設為大於 0 的值時，切片器會使用接點偏差演算法而非傳統 jerk 進行時間估算，並"
"在 G-code 中輸出 M205 J。\n"
"\n"
"接點偏差透過允許刀頭在轉角處偏離理想路徑此距離，提供更準確的轉角速度計算。\n"
"\n"
"典型值：0.01 - 0.08 mm\n"
"設為 0 則使用傳統 jerk（M205 XYZE）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:2930
msgid "M566 (Jerk)"
msgstr "M566（Jerk）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:2932
msgid ""
"Enter your M566 command from config.g.\n"
"\n"
"Sets jerk (instantaneous speed change) limits in mm/min.\n"
"The P parameter controls jerk policy:\n"
"  P0 (default): Jerk only between consecutive extrusion or travel moves\n"
"  P1: Marlin-like behavior (jerk between any moves)\n"
"\n"
"Default: M566 X900 Y900 Z600 E300 P0"
msgstr ""
"請輸入 config.g 中的 M566 指令。\n"
"\n"
"設定 jerk（瞬時速度變化）限制，單位 mm/min。\n"
"P 參數控制 jerk 策略：\n"
"  P0（預設）：僅在連續擠出或移動之間使用 jerk\n"
"  P1：類 Marlin 行為（任意移動之間皆使用 jerk）\n"
"\n"
"預設值：M566 X900 Y900 Z600 E300 P0"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:2942
msgid "M201 (Max Accel)"
msgstr "M201（最大加速度）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:2944
msgid ""
"Enter your M201 command from config.g.\n"
"\n"
"Sets maximum acceleration per axis in mm/s².\n"
"\n"
"Default: M201 X1000 Y1000 Z200 E500"
msgstr ""
"請輸入 config.g 中的 M201 指令。\n"
"\n"
"設定各軸的最大加速度，單位 mm/s²。\n"
"\n"
"預設值：M201 X1000 Y1000 Z200 E500"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:2951
msgid "M203 (Max Speed)"
msgstr "M203（最大速度）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:2953
msgid ""
"Enter your M203 command from config.g.\n"
"\n"
"Sets maximum feedrate per axis in mm/min (NOT mm/sec!).\n"
"\n"
"Default: M203 X6000 Y6000 Z1200 E6000"
msgstr ""
"請輸入 config.g 中的 M203 指令。\n"
"\n"
"設定各軸的最大進給速率，單位 mm/min（非 mm/sec！）。\n"
"\n"
"預設值：M203 X6000 Y6000 Z1200 E6000"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:2960
msgid "M204 (Accel)"
msgstr "M204（加速度）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:2962
msgid ""
"Enter your M204 command from config.g (optional).\n"
"\n"
"Sets print and travel acceleration in mm/s².\n"
"  P = Print acceleration (with extrusion)\n"
"  T = Travel acceleration (without extrusion)\n"
"\n"
"Optional - leave blank to let the M201 per-axis limits govern."
msgstr ""
"請輸入 config.g 中的 M204 指令（選用）。\n"
"\n"
"設定列印與移動加速度，單位 mm/s²。\n"
"  P = 列印加速度（含擠出）\n"
"  T = 移動加速度（不含擠出）\n"
"\n"
"選用 — 留空則由 M201 的各軸限制來控制。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:2971
msgid "M207 (Retract)"
msgstr "M207（回抽）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:2973
msgid ""
"Enter your M207 command from config.g (optional).\n"
"\n"
"Sets firmware retraction parameters:\n"
"  S = Retract length (mm)\n"
"  F = Retract feedrate (mm/min)\n"
"  T = Unretract feedrate (mm/min)\n"
"  Z = Z-lift during retract (mm)\n"
"  R = Extra unretract length (mm)\n"
"\n"
"Optional - leave blank if not using firmware retraction (G10/G11)."
msgstr ""
"請輸入 config.g 中的 M207 指令（選用）。\n"
"\n"
"設定韌體回抽參數：\n"
"  S = 回抽長度（mm）\n"
"  F = 回抽進給速率（mm/min）\n"
"  T = 退抽進給速率（mm/min）\n"
"  Z = 回抽時的 Z 抬升（mm）\n"
"  R = 額外退抽長度（mm）\n"
"\n"
"選用 — 若不使用韌體回抽（G10/G11）則留空。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:2986
msgid "Max velocity"
msgstr "最大速度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:2988
msgid ""
"Maximum velocity from your Klipper printer.cfg [printer] section.\n"
"\n"
"This is the global velocity limit for all moves.\n"
"\n"
"Can be changed mid-print with:\n"
"  SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT VELOCITY=<value>"
msgstr ""
"您 Klipper printer.cfg [printer] 區段中的最大速度。\n"
"\n"
"這是所有移動的全域速度限制。\n"
"\n"
"可在列印中以下列方式變更：\n"
"  SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT VELOCITY=<value>"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:2998
msgid "Max acceleration"
msgstr "最大加速度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3000
msgid ""
"Maximum acceleration from your Klipper printer.cfg [printer] section.\n"
"\n"
"This is the global acceleration limit for all moves.\n"
"\n"
"Can be changed mid-print with:\n"
"  SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT ACCEL=<value>\n"
"  M204 S<value>"
msgstr ""
"您 Klipper printer.cfg [printer] 區段中的最大加速度。\n"
"\n"
"這是所有移動的全域加速度限制。\n"
"\n"
"可在列印中以下列方式變更：\n"
"  SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT ACCEL=<value>\n"
"  M204 S<value>"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3011
msgid "Square corner velocity"
msgstr "方形轉角速度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3013
msgid ""
"Square corner velocity from your Klipper printer.cfg [printer] section.\n"
"\n"
"Controls how fast the toolhead moves through corners.\n"
"Higher values allow faster cornering but may cause ringing.\n"
"Klipper default is 5.0 mm/s.\n"
"\n"
"Can be changed mid-print with:\n"
"  SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT SQUARE_CORNER_VELOCITY=<value>"
msgstr ""
"您 Klipper printer.cfg [printer] 區段中的方形轉角速度。\n"
"\n"
"控制刀頭通過轉角的速度。\n"
"值越高轉角越快，但可能造成振紋。\n"
"Klipper 預設為 5.0 mm/s。\n"
"\n"
"可在列印中以下列方式變更：\n"
"  SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT SQUARE_CORNER_VELOCITY=<value>"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3025
msgid "Minimum cruise ratio"
msgstr "最小巡航比"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3027
msgid ""
"Minimum cruise ratio from your Klipper printer.cfg [printer] section.\n"
"\n"
"On short moves, the printer maintains at least this fraction\n"
"of the requested speed instead of decelerating fully.\n"
"Klipper default is 0.5 (50% of nominal speed).\n"
"\n"
"Can be changed mid-print with:\n"
"  SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT MINIMUM_CRUISE_RATIO=<value>"
msgstr ""
"您 Klipper printer.cfg [printer] 區段中的最小巡航比。\n"
"\n"
"在短移動上，印表機至少維持所要求速度的此比例，而非完全減速。\n"
"Klipper 預設為 0.5（標稱速度的 50%）。\n"
"\n"
"可在列印中以下列方式變更：\n"
"  SET_VELOCITY_LIMIT MINIMUM_CRUISE_RATIO=<value>"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3039
msgid "Real-World Compensation"
msgstr "真實世界補償"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3041
msgid ""
"Adjusts time estimates to better match real-world print times.\n"
"\n"
"Negative values increase the estimate (more conservative).\n"
"Positive values decrease the estimate (more aggressive).\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  -15% = Estimate will be 15% longer (recommended starting point)\n"
"  0% = No adjustment (pure physics calculation)\n"
"  +10% = Estimate will be 10% shorter\n"
"\n"
"Adjust based on how your actual prints compare to estimates."
msgstr ""
"調整時間估算以更貼近真實世界的列印時間。\n"
"\n"
"負值會增加估算值（較保守）。\n"
"正值會減少估算值（較積極）。\n"
"\n"
"範例：\n"
"  -15% = 估算值會長 15%（建議的起始點）\n"
"  0% = 不調整（純物理計算）\n"
"  +10% = 估算值會短 10%\n"
"\n"
"請根據您實際列印與估算的比較進行調整。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3057
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3059
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1019
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1217
msgid "Maximum acceleration when extruding"
msgstr "擠出時的最大加速度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3067
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1022
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1219
msgid "Maximum acceleration when retracting"
msgstr "回抽時的最大加速度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3069
msgid ""
"Maximum acceleration when retracting.\n"
"\n"
"Not used for RepRapFirmware, which does not support it."
msgstr ""
"回抽時的最大加速度。\n"
"\n"
"RepRapFirmware 不使用此項，因為其不支援。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3078
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1025
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1221
msgid "Maximum acceleration for travel moves"
msgstr "移動時的最大加速度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3080
msgid "Maximum acceleration for travel moves."
msgstr "移動的最大加速度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3087
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3096
msgid "Max"
msgstr "最大"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3088
msgid "This setting represents the maximum speed of your fan."
msgstr "此設定代表風扇的最高轉度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3097
msgid ""
"This is the highest printable layer height for this extruder, used to cap "
"the variable layer height and support layer height. Maximum recommended "
"layer height is 75% of the extrusion width to achieve reasonable inter-layer "
"adhesion. If set to 0, layer height is limited to 75% of the nozzle diameter."
msgstr ""
"這是該擠出機的最高可打印層高度，用於覆寫可變層高度和支援層高度。建議的最大層"
"高為擠出寬度的75%，以實現合理的層間黏結。如果設定為 0，則層高限制為噴嘴直徑"
"的 75% 。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3107
msgid "Auto speed"
msgstr "自動速度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3108
msgid ""
"When enabled, print move speeds are automatically calculated from each "
"filament's max volumetric flow and capped at Max print speed. Bridge and "
"small perimeter speeds remain manual (set to 0 for auto speed). Over-bridge "
"set to 0 uses solid infill speed. Gap fill set to 0 disables it."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，列印移動速度會自每種線材的最大體積流量自動計算，並以最大列印速度為上"
"限。橋接與小輪廓速度維持手動（設為 0 表示自動速度）。橋接上方設為 0 則使用實"
"心填充速度。間隙填補設為 0 則停用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3117
msgid ""
"The maximum speed for any print move when using auto speed, or the fallback "
"speed when individual speeds are set to 0."
msgstr ""
"使用自動速度時任何列印移動的最大速度，或當個別速度設為 0 時的後備速度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3127
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3138
msgid ""
"Print-level cap on volumetric flow. When greater than zero, it clamps each "
"filament's Max volumetric flow if this value is lower, limiting auto speed "
"accordingly. Set to 0 to rely solely on the filament's Max volumetric flow."
msgstr ""
"列印層級的體積流量上限。當大於零時，如果該值較低，則限制每種線材的最大體積流"
"量，並相應地限制自動速度。設為0以僅依賴線材的最大體積流量。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3147
msgid "Max volumetric slope positive"
msgstr "最大正體積斜率"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3148
msgid ""
"This experimental setting is used to limit the speed of change in extrusion "
"rate for a transition from lower speed to higher speed. A value of 1.8 mm³/"
"s² ensures, that a change from the extrusion rate of 1.8 mm³/s (0.45 mm "
"extrusion width, 0.2 mm extrusion height, feedrate 20 mm/s) to 5.4 mm³/s "
"(feedrate 60 mm/s) will take at least 2 seconds."
msgstr ""
"這個實驗設定用於限制擠出速率的變化速度，以實現從較低速度到較高速度的轉變。 "
"1.8 mm³/s² 的值確保擠出速率從 1.8 mm³/s（0.45 mm 擠出寬度，0.2 mm 擠出高度，"
"進給速度 20 mm/s）變為 5.4 mm³/s（進給速度 60 mm/s）至少需要 2 秒。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3153
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3165
msgid "mm³/s²"
msgstr "mm³/s²"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3159
msgid "Max volumetric slope negative"
msgstr "最大負體積斜率"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3160
msgid ""
"This experimental setting is used to limit the speed of change in extrusion "
"rate for a transition from higher speed to lower speed. A value of 1.8 mm³/"
"s² ensures, that a change from the extrusion rate of 5.4 mm³/s (0.45 mm "
"extrusion width, 0.2 mm extrusion height, feedrate 60 mm/s) to 1.8 mm³/s "
"(feedrate 20 mm/s) will take at least 2 seconds."
msgstr ""
"這個實驗設定用於限制擠出速率的變化速度，以實現從高速到低速的轉變。 1.8 mm³/"
"s² 的值確保擠出速率從 5.4 mm³/s（0.45 mm 擠出寬度，0.2 mm 擠出高度，進給速度 "
"60 mm/s）變為 1.8 mm³/s（進給速度 20 mm/s）至少需要 2 秒。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3171
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3180
msgid "Min"
msgstr "最小"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3172
msgid "This setting represents the minimum PWM your fan needs to work."
msgstr "此設定表示您的風扇工作所需的最小 PWM。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3181
msgid ""
"This is the lowest printable layer height for this extruder and limits the "
"resolution for variable layer height. Typical values are between 0.05 mm and "
"0.1 mm."
msgstr ""
"這是該擠出機的最低可打印層高，並限制了可變層高的解析度。一般的設定值介於 "
"0.05 mm和 0.1 mm之間。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3189
msgid "Min print speed"
msgstr "最小打印速度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3190
msgid "preFlight will not slow down below this speed."
msgstr "preFlight 不會將速度降低到低於此設定的速度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3197
msgid "Minimal filament extrusion length"
msgstr "最小的線材擠出長度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3198
msgid ""
"Generate no less than the number of skirt loops required to consume the "
"specified amount of filament on the bottom layer. For multi-extruder "
"machines, this minimum applies to each extruder."
msgstr ""
"在底層上消耗指定的材料量以產生裙邊，對於多擠出機的機器而言，這個最小值也適用"
"於每個擠出機。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3207
msgid "Configuration notes"
msgstr "設定註釋"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3208
msgid ""
"You can put here your personal notes. This text will be added to the G-code "
"header comments."
msgstr "您可以把個人註釋放在這裡。此內容將添加到 G-code 標題註釋中。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3217
msgid "Custom print parameters"
msgstr "自訂列印參數"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3219
#, boost-format
msgid ""
"JSON-encoded string defining extra parameters, which can later be expanded "
"in Custom G-code macro language. Each of the parameters is prepended by %1% "
"prefix before it is passed into the parser. For example, defining "
"'{\"my_key\": \"my_value\"}' allows to use '%1%_my_key'.\n"
"\n"
"The JSON must be single level (no arrays and objects). All value types are "
"allowed, but nulls will be rejected by the parser."
msgstr ""
"定義額外參數的 JSON 編碼字串，稍後可在自訂 G-code 巨集語言中展開。每個參數在"
"傳入剖析器前會加上 %1% 前綴。例如，定義 '{\"my_key\": \"my_value\"}' 即可使"
"用 '%1%_my_key'。\n"
"\n"
"JSON 必須為單層（無陣列與物件）。允許所有值類型，但 null 會被剖析器拒絕。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3232
msgid "Print nozzle diameters"
msgstr "列印噴嘴直徑"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3234
msgid ""
"Nozzle diameters for this print profile. When set, these values override the "
"printer's nozzle diameters."
msgstr "此列印設定檔的噴嘴直徑。設定後，這些值會覆寫印表機的噴嘴直徑。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3242
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3922
msgid "High flow nozzle"
msgstr "高流量噴嘴"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3243
msgid "Print preset-specific high flow nozzle settings"
msgstr "列印預設特定的高流量噴嘴設定"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3248
msgid "Nozzle diameter"
msgstr "噴嘴孔徑"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3249
msgid ""
"This is the diameter of your extruder nozzle (for example: 0.5, 0.35 etc.)"
msgstr "這是擠出機噴嘴的直徑（例如：0.5、0.35 等）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3254
msgid "Width warning min"
msgstr "寬度警告下限"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3255
msgid ""
"Warn while editing when a configured extrusion width falls below this "
"percentage of the nozzle diameter. Generated beads such as gap fill and thin "
"walls are narrower by design and are not checked."
msgstr ""
"編輯時，若設定的擠出寬度低於噴嘴直徑的此百分比，則發出警告。間隙填充與薄壁等"
"生成的線條本來就設計得較窄，不會被檢查。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3264
msgid "Width warning max"
msgstr "寬度警告上限"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3265
msgid ""
"Warn when an extrusion width exceeds this percentage of the nozzle diameter: "
"configured values are checked while editing, and generated wall and fill "
"widths are checked as they are produced while slicing. Support, skirt, brim "
"and wipe tower widths are not checked. Set it to the widest bead the nozzle "
"can properly iron down. Interlocking perimeters are exempt: their wide "
"bonding beads are intentional."
msgstr ""
"當擠出寬度超過噴嘴直徑的此百分比時發出警告：編輯時會檢查設定值，切片過程中會"
"在生成壁與填充寬度時對其進行檢查。支撐、側裙、帽邊與擦拭塔的寬度不會被檢查。"
"請將其設為噴嘴仍能妥善熨平的最寬線條。互鎖輪廓不受此限制：其寬黏合線條是刻意"
"設計的。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3277
msgid "Host Type"
msgstr "主機類型"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3278
msgid ""
"preFlight can upload G-code files to a printer host. This field must contain "
"the kind of the host."
msgstr ""
"preFlight 可以將 G-code 檔案上傳到打印機主機。該字串必須包含主機的種類。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3295
msgid "Only retract when crossing perimeters"
msgstr "僅在穿越邊緣時回抽"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3296
msgid ""
"Disables retraction when the travel path does not exceed the upper layer's "
"perimeters (and thus any ooze will be probably invisible)."
msgstr ""
"在行進路徑不會超過上層邊緣時禁用回抽（可能因此設定而消除渗漏或牽絲的問題）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3302
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5271
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:737
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:739
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:741
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:743
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "啟用"

#. TRN PrintSettings: Enable ooze prevention
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3304
msgid ""
"This option will drop the temperature of the inactive extruders to prevent "
"oozing."
msgstr "此選項會降低未使用擠出機的溫度以防止滲漏。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3309
msgid "Output filename format"
msgstr "輸出檔案名稱格式"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3310
msgid ""
"You can use all configuration options as variables inside this template. For "
"example: [layer_height], [fill_density] etc. You can also use [timestamp], "
"[year], [month], [day], [hour], [minute], [second], [version], "
"[input_filename_base], [default_output_extension]."
msgstr ""
"您可以在此範本中將所有設定選項作為變數使用。例如：[layer_height]、"
"[fill_density] 等。您也可以使用 [timestamp]、[year]、[month]、[day]、[hour]、"
"[minute]、[second]、[version]、[input_filename_base]、"
"[default_output_extension]。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3319
msgid "Detect bridging perimeters"
msgstr "檢測橋接邊緣"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3321
msgid ""
"Experimental option to adjust flow for overhangs (bridge flow will be used), "
"to apply bridge speed to them and enable fan."
msgstr ""
"調整懸空時流量的實驗選項（此時會使用橋接流量），將橋接速度應用於它們並啟用風"
"扇。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3327
msgid "Filament parking position"
msgstr "線材停放的位置"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3328
msgid ""
"Distance of the extruder tip from the position where the filament is parked "
"when unloaded. This should match the value in printer firmware."
msgstr ""
"擠出機尖端與卸載線材時停放位置的距離。這必須與打印機韌體中的設定值配合。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3336
msgid "Extra loading distance"
msgstr "額外的線材匯入長度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3337
msgid ""
"When set to zero, the distance the filament is moved from parking position "
"during load is exactly the same as it was moved back during unload. When "
"positive, it is loaded further,  if negative, the loading move is shorter "
"than unloading."
msgstr ""
"當設定為零時，線材於匯入過程中從停留位置移出的距離與卸料期間移回的距離完全相"
"同。當為正數時他會被進一步加載，若為負數則加載的移動量比卸載時短。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3345
msgid "Purging volume"
msgstr "清料體積"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3346
msgid ""
"Determines purging volume on the wipe tower. This can be modified in "
"Filament Settings ('filament_purge_multiplier') or overridden using project-"
"specific settings."
msgstr ""
"決定擦拭塔上的清料體積。這可在線材設定（'filament_purge_multiplier'）中修改，"
"或使用專案特定設定覆寫。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3353
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3378
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3393
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3403
msgid "Perimeters"
msgstr "邊緣"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3354
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will use for perimeters. Set zero to "
"disable acceleration control for perimeters."
msgstr "這是打印機將用於邊緣打印的加速度。設定為零以禁用邊緣打印的加速度控制。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3362
msgid ""
"This is the acceleration your printer will use for external perimeters. Set "
"zero to use the value for perimeters."
msgstr "這是印表機用於外輪廓的加速度。設為 0 則使用輪廓的值。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3369
msgid "Perimeter extruder"
msgstr "邊緣擠出機"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3371
msgid ""
"The extruder to use when printing perimeters and brim. First extruder is 1."
msgstr "打印邊緣和帽邊所使用的擠出機。第一個擠出機數字是 1。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3381
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for perimeters. "
"You may want to use thinner extrudates to get more accurate surfaces. If "
"left zero, default extrusion width will be used if set, otherwise 1.125 x "
"nozzle diameter will be used. If expressed as percentage (for example 200%) "
"it will be computed over nozzle diameter or layer height, depending on the "
"'Percentages relative to nozzle size' setting."
msgstr ""
"設為非零值可為輪廓手動設定擠出寬度。您可以使用較細的擠出來取得更精確的表面。"
"若維持 0，將使用預設擠出寬度（若有設定），否則使用 1.125 倍噴嘴直徑。若以百分"
"比表示（例如 200%），則依「百分比相對於噴嘴尺寸」設定，以噴嘴直徑或層高計算。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3395
msgid ""
"Speed for perimeters (contours, aka vertical shells). Set to zero for auto."
msgstr "邊緣打印的速度（輪廓，又稱為垂直外殼）。零為自動設定。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3405
msgid ""
"This option sets the minimum number of perimeters to generate for each "
"layer. preFlight may add extra perimeter loops in areas where the wall is "
"wider than a single perimeter loop but too narrow for infill. The Extra "
"Perimeters option can also increase this number on sloping surfaces."
msgstr ""
"此選項設定每層要產生的最少輪廓數。在壁面比單道輪廓寬但又太窄無法填充的區域，"
"preFlight 可能會增加額外的輪廓迴圈。「額外輪廓」選項也可能在傾斜表面增加此數"
"量。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3409
msgid "(minimum)"
msgstr "（最低）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3416
msgid "Enable Serpentine"
msgstr "啟用蛇形"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3418
msgid ""
"Prints a region as a continuous serpentine extrusion: a single line that "
"weaves back and forth, inward from the walls. Without a depth limit it fills "
"the whole cross-section, replacing the region's perimeters and infill; with "
"a depth limit it forms a band along the walls and the interior is filled "
"with normal infill.\n"
"\n"
"Enabling this switches the perimeter generator to Athena and takes over the "
"region's perimeters and most related wall settings.\n"
"\n"
"Best on simple, symmetric parts such as nuts, bolts, and knurled knobs; "
"complex shapes may slice poorly."
msgstr ""
"將區域列印為連續的蛇形擠出：一條從壁向內來回蜿蜒的單一線條。未設定深度限制"
"時，會填滿整個橫截面，取代該區域的邊緣與填充；設定深度限制後，會沿壁形成一圈"
"帶狀區域，內部則採用普通填充。\n"
"\n"
"啟用此項會將邊緣產生器切換為 Athena，並接管該區域的邊緣及大多數相關壁設定。\n"
"\n"
"在螺帽、螺栓、滾花旋鈕等簡單對稱的零件上效果最佳；複雜形狀可能切片效果不佳。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3429
msgid "Serpentine extrusion width"
msgstr "蛇形擠出寬度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3431
msgid ""
"Width of the serpentine extrusion. If expressed as percentage (for example "
"105%), it will be computed over layer height. Set to 0 to use the external "
"perimeter extrusion width."
msgstr ""
"蛇形擠出線的寬度。若以百分比表示(例如 105%),將按層高計算。設為 0 則使用外部邊"
"緣擠出寬度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3440
msgid "Serpentine overlap"
msgstr "蛇形重疊"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3442
msgid ""
"How deeply neighboring serpentine beads bond into each other. Percent values "
"are computed over layer height, matching the Interlocking overlap semantics. "
"Negative values spread the beads apart instead, leaving a uniform gap "
"between them that lowers the effective density.\n"
"\n"
"Default: 10.73% (safe starting point)"
msgstr ""
"相鄰蛇形擠出線相互結合的深度。百分比值按層高計算,與互鎖重疊的含義一致。負值則"
"將擠出線彼此分開,在它們之間留下均勻的間隙,從而降低有效密度。\n"
"\n"
"預設:10.73%(安全起點)"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3454
msgid "Serpentine maximum bead width"
msgstr "蛇形最大線寬"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3456
msgid ""
"Upper limit for bead widening, as a percent of the nozzle diameter. Where "
"the pattern opens up at depth, beads grow up to this width to fill the gap."
msgstr ""
"擠出線加寬的上限(佔噴嘴直徑的百分比)。在圖案於深處張開的地方,擠出線會加寬到此"
"寬度以填補空隙。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3464
msgid "Relaxed spacing"
msgstr "寬鬆間距"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3466
msgid ""
"Space the serpentine teeth apart instead of packing them tightly: the bead "
"follows the wall cleanly for the distance set below, then turns inward as a "
"single solid rib and returns to the wall, like spokes on a wheel. The "
"spacing acts as a fill density control while the part keeps one continuous "
"bead and a single-bead wall.\n"
"\n"
"Ribs stack vertically into continuous webs (the Ridges setting is ignored) "
"and holes print as plain single-bead loops. The interior stays mostly open, "
"so this suits open-top parts; solid top surfaces cannot bridge the cells. "
"Overrides the depth limit when both are enabled."
msgstr ""
"將蛇形齒分開而非緊密排列：線乾淨地沿壁面延伸下方設定的距離，接著以一條完整的"
"筋向內轉彎並返回壁面，就像輪子上的輻條。間距可作為填充密度控制，同時零件維持"
"一條連續的線與單線壁。\n"
"\n"
"筋垂直堆疊成連續的腹板（脊線設定將被忽略），孔則以簡單的單線環列印。內部大致"
"保持開放，因此適合頂部開放的零件；實心頂面無法橋接這些空腔。兩者皆啟用時，將"
"覆蓋深度限制。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3477
msgid "Rib spacing"
msgstr "筋間距"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3479
msgid ""
"Distance the bead follows the wall between ribs when Relaxed spacing is "
"enabled. Ribs march from the seam at exactly this spacing in both "
"directions; the leftover is absorbed by one wider or narrower cell on the "
"far side, so rib columns stack into unbroken vertical webs even on tapered "
"parts. Smaller values pack more ribs (denser fill); values below about two "
"extrusion widths are floored to the classic dense pitch."
msgstr ""
"啟用寬鬆間距時，筋之間線沿壁面延伸的距離。筋從接縫起沿兩個方向精確地依此間距"
"排列；多餘部分由遠端一個較寬或較窄的空腔吸收，因此即使在錐形零件上，筋列也會"
"堆疊成不間斷的垂直腹板。數值越小，筋越密集（填充更密）；低於約兩倍擠出寬度的"
"數值，將被限制為經典密集間距。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3490
msgid "Outer surface loop"
msgstr "外表面迴圈"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3492
msgid ""
"Wraps one continuous perimeter around the outside of the serpentine pattern "
"and moves the tooth-carrying wall just inside it, bonded to it. The tooth "
"openings then interrupt only the hidden inner wall, so the outer surface is "
"a single uninterrupted bead: the extrusion snakes out through one widened "
"tooth, loops the whole object, and snakes back in, leaving a single seam-"
"like crossover. The pattern stacks aligned so the seam forms one vertical "
"column (the Ridges setting is ignored). Works at both classic and relaxed "
"spacing."
msgstr ""
"用一條連續邊緣包覆蛇形圖案的外側，並將承載齒的壁移到其內側緊貼處，與之黏合。"
"齒的開口隨後僅中斷隱藏的內壁，因此外表面是一條不間斷的線：擠出透過一個加寬的"
"齒向外蜿蜒，繞行整個物件，再蜿蜒返回，只留下一處類似接縫的交叉點。圖案對齊堆"
"疊，使接縫形成一條垂直行列（脊線設定將被忽略）。在經典與寬鬆間距下皆可使用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3502
msgid "Limit Serpentine depth"
msgstr "限制蛇形深度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3504
msgid ""
"Restrict the serpentine pattern to a wall of the depth set below instead of "
"filling the whole region. The interior beyond that depth is filled normally "
"(sparse infill, solid top and bottom layers), exactly like the leftover area "
"behind ordinary perimeters. When disabled, the serpentine fills the entire "
"region."
msgstr ""
"將蛇形圖案限制在下方設定深度的壁內，而非填充整個區域。超出該深度的內部以正常"
"方式填充（稀疏填充、實體頂底層），與普通邊緣後方的剩餘區域處理方式完全相同。"
"停用時，蛇形將填充整個區域。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3511
msgid "Serpentine depth"
msgstr "蛇形深度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3513
msgid ""
"Maximum depth the serpentine wall reaches inward from the surface when "
"\"Limit Serpentine depth\" is enabled. The interior beyond this depth is "
"filled normally.\n"
"\n"
"The smallest pattern that can close is two extrusion widths, so any smaller "
"value is raised to that minimum."
msgstr ""
"啟用「限制蛇形深度」時蛇形壁從表面向內延伸的最大深度。超出該深度的內部以正常"
"方式填充。\n"
"\n"
"可閉合的最小圖案為兩個擠出寬度；任何更小的值都會被提升到該最小值。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3522
msgid "Solid top/bottom surfaces"
msgstr "頂面/底面實心"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3524
msgid ""
"Print the visible portions of top and bottom surfaces as ordinary solid "
"infill, using the solid layer counts from Horizontal shells. The boundary "
"keeps the serpentine zigzag at its shortest depth so the side pattern stays "
"continuous, and covered interior areas continue as serpentine."
msgstr ""
"按水平外殼的實心層數,將頂面和底面的可見部分列印為普通實心填充。邊界保留最短深"
"度的蛇形鋸齒帶,側面圖案因此保持連續,被遮蓋的內部區域繼續使用蛇形列印。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3531
msgid "Serpentine ridges"
msgstr "蛇形脊線"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3533
msgid ""
"Controls how the external zigzag ridges stack from layer to layer.\n"
"• Aligned: ridges stack vertically into straight columns.\n"
"• Staggered: the pattern staggers half a tooth each layer, so every cap is "
"bridged by the layers above and below (brickwork).\n"
"• Random: the pattern lands at a random position on every layer."
msgstr ""
"控制外部鋸齒脊線在層間的堆疊方式。\n"
"• 對齊：脊線垂直堆疊成筆直的立柱。\n"
"• 交錯：圖案每層偏移半個齒距，使每個頂蓋由上下兩層架橋連接（磚砌排列）。\n"
"• 隨機：圖案每層落在隨機位置。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3539
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4006
msgid "Aligned"
msgstr "對齊"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3539
msgid "Staggered"
msgstr "交錯"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3539
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4006
#: src/DSKY/GUI/ArrangeSettingsDialogImgui.cpp:101
msgid "Random"
msgstr "隨機"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3543
msgid "Serpentine aim"
msgstr "蛇形瞄準方向"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3545
msgid ""
"How depth-limited Serpentine teeth are aimed. Convergent points every tooth "
"at the part center, giving a smooth radial fan (best for round parts like "
"bolts and nuts). Perpendicular points each tooth square to the wall (best "
"for curved or irregular parts). Only applies when depth limit is on."
msgstr ""
"限制深度的蛇形齒的瞄準方式。收斂模式將每顆齒指向零件中心，形成平滑的放射狀扇"
"形（最適合螺栓、螺帽等圓形零件）。垂直模式將每顆齒垂直於壁面（最適合曲線或不"
"規則零件）。僅在啟用深度限制時生效。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3550
msgid "Convergent"
msgstr "收斂"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3551
msgid "Perpendicular"
msgstr "垂直"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3555
msgid "Enable interlocking perimeters"
msgstr "啟用互鎖輪廓"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3557
msgid ""
"Creates interlocking layers by varying spacing of innermost perimeters "
"across layers. When combined with over-extrusion, material compresses into "
"gaps for enhanced layer bonding. Expected strength increase: 10-15% with no "
"additional material or time cost."
msgstr ""
"透過在各層間改變最內側輪廓的間距來建立互鎖層。當與過度擠出結合時，材料會壓入"
"縫隙以增強層間黏合。預期強度提升：10-15%，且無額外材料或時間成本。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3564
msgid "Interlocking perimeter count"
msgstr "互鎖輪廓數"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3566
msgid ""
"Number of interlocking perimeter shells at sparse infill boundaries. These "
"shells alternate overlap patterns between layers - each layer creates gaps "
"that the next layer fills, forming mechanical interlocking."
msgstr ""
"稀疏填充邊界處的互鎖輪廓殼層數。這些殼層在各層間交替重疊圖案 - 每層建立縫隙供"
"下一層填補，形成機械互鎖。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3569
#: src/DSKY/GUI/PresetHints.cpp:223
msgid "perimeters"
msgstr "邊緣"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3575
msgid "Perimeters while interlocking"
msgstr "互鎖時的輪廓數"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3577
msgid ""
"Overrides the number of regular perimeters on layers where interlocking is "
"active. Layers near top/bottom surfaces (controlled by the solid layers "
"settings) use the normal perimeter count.\n"
"\n"
"0 = use the normal Perimeters setting (no override)\n"
">0 = use this many regular perimeters on interlocking layers\n"
"\n"
"This allows thinner walls on interior layers while retaining interlocking "
"strength."
msgstr ""
"覆寫互鎖作用層上的一般輪廓數。靠近頂/底面的層（由實心層設定控制）使用一般輪廓"
"數。\n"
"\n"
"0 = 使用一般輪廓設定（不覆寫）\n"
">0 = 在互鎖層上使用此數量的一般輪廓\n"
"\n"
"這可讓內部各層使用較薄的壁面，同時保留互鎖強度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3583
msgid "(0 = off)"
msgstr "（0 = 關閉）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3590 src/DSKY/GUI/Search.cpp:114
msgid "Above"
msgstr "上方"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3591
msgid "Solid layers above interlocking"
msgstr "互鎖上方的實心層"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3593
msgid ""
"Number of solid layers between interlocking perimeters and a top surface. "
"Ensures the interlocking pattern is fully hidden inside the object."
msgstr "互鎖輪廓與頂面之間的實心層數。確保互鎖圖案完全隱藏在物件內部。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3600 src/DSKY/GUI/Search.cpp:114
msgid "Below"
msgstr "下方"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3601
msgid "Solid layers below interlocking"
msgstr "互鎖下方的實心層"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3603
msgid ""
"Number of solid layers between interlocking perimeters and a bottom surface. "
"Ensures the interlocking pattern is fully hidden inside the object."
msgstr "互鎖輪廓與底面之間的實心層數。確保互鎖圖案完全隱藏在物件內部。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3610
msgid "Interlocking overlap"
msgstr "互鎖重疊"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3612
msgid ""
"Controls the gap width between interlocking shells. Higher values narrow the "
"channels and compress more material into the interlocking pattern, resulting "
"in a stronger bond.\n"
"\n"
"Default: 10.73% (safe starting point)\n"
"\n"
"Start with a test print at 10.73% and increase gradually until over-"
"extrusion is reached, then dial it back to the last safe value."
msgstr ""
"控制互鎖殼層之間的縫隙寬度。值越高，通道越窄，壓入互鎖圖案的材料越多，黏合越"
"強。\n"
"\n"
"預設：10.73%（安全的起始點）\n"
"\n"
"從 10.73% 開始進行測試列印，逐步增加直到出現過度擠出，再回調至最後的安全值。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3626
msgid "Interlocking perimeter extruder"
msgstr "互鎖輪廓擠出機"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3628
msgid ""
"The extruder to use when printing interlocking perimeters. First extruder is "
"1."
msgstr "列印互鎖輪廓時使用的擠出機。第一個擠出機為 1。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3634
msgid "Interlocking flow detection"
msgstr "互鎖流量偵測"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3636
msgid ""
"Controls how precisely interlocking flow boundaries are detected. When "
"interlocking perimeters cross from over-interlocking to non-interlocking "
"regions, the flow rate must change. This setting determines how frequently "
"boundaries are checked.\n"
"\n"
"• Precise (1mm): Highest accuracy, checks every 1mm. Best quality at "
"boundaries.\n"
"• Standard (2mm): Good balance of accuracy and speed.\n"
"• Relaxed (4mm): Faster slicing, minor boundary imprecision.\n"
"• Minimal (8mm): Fastest slicing, noticeable imprecision at boundaries.\n"
"\n"
"Lower values increase slicing time but improve flow accuracy at zone "
"boundaries."
msgstr ""
"控制偵測互鎖流量邊界的精確程度。當互鎖輪廓從過度互鎖區跨越到非互鎖區時，流量"
"必須變化。此設定決定檢查邊界的頻率。\n"
"\n"
"• 精確（1mm）：精度最高，每 1mm 檢查一次。邊界品質最佳。\n"
"• 標準（2mm）：精度與速度的良好平衡。\n"
"• 寬鬆（4mm）：切片較快，邊界略有不精確。\n"
"• 最低（8mm）：切片最快，邊界明顯不精確。\n"
"\n"
"值越低，切片時間越長，但區域邊界的流量精度越高。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3651
msgid "Post-processing scripts"
msgstr "後處理腳本"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3652
msgid ""
"If you want to process the output G-code through custom scripts, just list "
"their absolute paths here. Separate multiple scripts with a semicolon. "
"Scripts will be passed the absolute path to the G-code file as the first "
"argument, and they can access the preFlight config settings by reading "
"environment variables."
msgstr ""
"如果您想經由自定義腳本處理輸出的 G-code，只需在此處列出它們的絕對路徑即可。用"
"分號來分隔多個腳本。腳本將作為第一個參數傳遞到 G-code 檔案的絕對路徑，並且它"
"們可以經由讀取環境變數來存取 preFlight 設定檔之設定。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3664
msgid "Enable export script"
msgstr "啟用匯出腳本"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3665
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3674
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:667
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:669
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:671
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:673
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:675
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:677
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:679
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1171
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Sidebar.cpp:1687
msgid "Output options"
msgstr "輸出選項"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3666
msgid ""
"When enabled, an 'Export to Script' option appears in the export menu. The "
"configured Python script receives the G-code data and handles output - "
"saving to disk, uploading via FTP, or both."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，匯出選單中會出現「匯出至腳本」選項。設定的 Python 腳本會接收 G-code "
"資料並處理輸出 - 儲存至磁碟、透過 FTP 上傳，或兩者皆是。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3673
msgid "Export script"
msgstr "匯出腳本"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3675
msgid ""
"Path to a Python script that handles G-code export. The script must define "
"an export(gcode) function that receives a gcode object with .data (list of G-"
"code lines) and .filename (suggested output name)."
msgstr ""
"處理 G-code 匯出的 Python 腳本路徑。腳本必須定義一個 export(gcode) 函式，接收"
"含 .data（G-code 行清單）與 .filename（建議的輸出名稱）的 gcode 物件。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3682
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3689
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3696
msgid "Enable preprocessing"
msgstr "啟用預處理"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3683
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3690
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3697
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3704
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3710
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3716
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:665
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:921
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1133
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1170
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1179
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1186
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1194 src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1320
msgid "Preprocessing"
msgstr "預處理"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3684
msgid ""
"Enable Python preprocessing scripts for this filament profile. Scripts run "
"during slicing and can read/modify G-code moves."
msgstr ""
"為此線材設定檔啟用 Python 預處理腳本。腳本在切片期間執行，可讀取/修改 G-code "
"移動。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3691
msgid ""
"Enable Python preprocessing scripts for this print profile. Scripts run "
"during slicing and can read/modify G-code moves."
msgstr ""
"為此列印設定檔啟用 Python 預處理腳本。腳本在切片期間執行，可讀取/修改 G-code "
"移動。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3698
msgid ""
"Enable Python preprocessing scripts for this printer profile. Scripts run "
"during slicing and can read/modify G-code moves."
msgstr ""
"為此印表機設定檔啟用 Python 預處理腳本。腳本在切片期間執行，可讀取/修改 G-"
"code 移動。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3703
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3709
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3715
msgid "Preprocessing scripts"
msgstr "預處理腳本"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3705
msgid ""
"Ordered list of Python preprocessing script paths for this filament profile."
msgstr "此線材設定檔的 Python 預處理腳本路徑（有序清單）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3711
msgid ""
"Ordered list of Python preprocessing script paths for this print profile."
msgstr "此列印設定檔的 Python 預處理腳本路徑（有序清單）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3717
msgid ""
"Ordered list of Python preprocessing script paths for this printer profile."
msgstr "此印表機設定檔的 Python 預處理腳本路徑（有序清單）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3721
msgid "Printer type"
msgstr "打印機類型"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3722
msgid "Type of the printer."
msgstr "打印機的類型。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3727
msgid "Printer notes"
msgstr "打印機備註"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3728
msgid "You can put your notes regarding the printer here."
msgstr "您可以在此處放置有關打印機的註釋。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3736
msgid "Printer vendor"
msgstr "打印機供應商"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3737
msgid "Name of the printer vendor."
msgstr "打印機供應商的名稱。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3742
msgid "Printer variant"
msgstr "打印機型號"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3744
msgid ""
"Name of the printer variant. For example, the printer variants may be "
"differentiated by a nozzle diameter."
msgstr "打印機變體的名稱。例如，打印機變體可以經由噴嘴直徑來區分。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3761
msgid "Raft contact Z distance"
msgstr "筏板接觸Z軸的距離"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3763
msgid ""
"The vertical distance between object and raft. Ignored for soluble interface."
msgstr "模型和筏板之間的垂直距離。請忽略可溶性介面。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3770
msgid "Raft expansion"
msgstr "擴張筏板"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3772
msgid "Expansion of the raft in XY plane for better stability."
msgstr "在 XY 平面中擴張筏板以獲得更好的穩定性。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3779
msgid "First layer density"
msgstr "第一層密度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3781
msgid "Density of the first raft or support layer."
msgstr "第一筏板或支撐層的密度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3789
msgid "First layer expansion"
msgstr "第一層的擴張"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3791
msgid ""
"Expansion of the first raft or support layer to improve adhesion to print "
"bed."
msgstr "擴張第一層或支撐層以提高對模型對載台的附著力。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3798
msgid "Raft layers"
msgstr "筏板打印層"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3800
msgid ""
"The object will be raised by this number of layers, and support material "
"will be generated under it."
msgstr "該模型將按此層數升高，並在其下方生成支撐材料。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3808
msgid "Slice resolution"
msgstr "切片解析度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3809
msgid ""
"Minimum detail resolution, used to simplify the input file for speeding up "
"the slicing job and reducing memory usage. High-resolution models often "
"carry more detail than printers can render. Set to zero to disable any "
"simplification and use full resolution from input."
msgstr ""
"最小細節解析度，用於簡化輸入檔案以加快切片作業並減少記憶體使用。超高解析度模"
"型通常包含比打印機算繪更多的細節。設定為零以禁用任何簡化並使用來自輸入的超高"
"解析度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3819
msgid "G-code resolution"
msgstr "G-code 解析度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3821
msgid ""
"Maximum deviation of exported G-code paths from their full resolution "
"counterparts. Very high resolution G-code requires huge amount of RAM to "
"slice and preview, also a 3D printer may stutter not being able to process a "
"high resolution G-code in a timely manner. On the other hand, a low "
"resolution G-code will produce a low poly effect and because the G-code "
"reduction is performed at each layer independently, visible artifacts may be "
"produced."
msgstr ""
"匯出的 G-code 路徑與其超高解析度對應路徑的最大偏差。非常高解析度的 G-code 需"
"要大量的 RAM 來切片和預覽，而且 3D 打印機可能無法及時處理高解析度的 G-code 。"
"另一方面，低解析度的 G-code 會產生低多邊形效果，並且由於 G-code 減少是在每一"
"層獨立執行的，因此可能會產生可見的虛像。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3832
msgid "Minimum travel after retraction"
msgstr "回抽後的最小行程"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3833
msgid ""
"Retraction is not triggered when travel moves are shorter than this length."
msgstr "當行程移動短於此長度時，不會觸發回抽。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3839
msgid "Retract amount before wipe"
msgstr "回擦前回抽量"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3840
msgid ""
"With bowden extruders, it may be wise to do some amount of quick retract "
"before doing the wipe movement."
msgstr ""
"對於 Bowden 擠出機，在進行回擦運動之前進行一定量的快速回抽可能是明智的。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3847
msgid "Extend wipe"
msgstr "延伸擦拭"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3848
msgid ""
"When enabled, the wipe move continues in the same direction as the last "
"extrusion move. When disabled (default), the wipe follows the perimeter loop "
"for the duration of the move."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，擦拭移動會沿最後一次擠出移動的相同方向繼續。停用時（預設），擦拭會在"
"移動期間沿輪廓迴圈進行。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3854
msgid "Wipe length"
msgstr "擦拭長度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3855
msgid ""
"Length of the wipe move. When using firmware retraction or without 'Wipe "
"while retracting', the wipe will be a pure travel move (no retraction). Set "
"to 0 to use the default wipe behavior based on retraction length."
msgstr ""
"擦拭移動的長度。使用韌體回抽或未啟用「回抽時擦拭」時，擦拭將是純移動（無回"
"抽）。設為 0 則使用基於回抽長度的預設擦拭行為。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3864
msgid "Retract on layer change"
msgstr "撤回打印層的更改"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3865
msgid "This flag enforces a retraction whenever a Z move is done."
msgstr "每當完成 Z 軸移動時，此標簽都會強制回抽。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3870
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:908
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1128
msgid "Retraction length"
msgstr "回抽長度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3871
msgid "Retraction Length"
msgstr "回抽長度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3872
msgid ""
"When retraction is triggered, filament is pulled back by the specified "
"amount (the length is measured on raw filament, before it enters the "
"extruder)."
msgstr ""
"當觸發回抽時，線材被拉回指定的量（長度是在原本線材進入擠出機之前測量的）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3878
#: src/DSKY/GUI/Gizmos/GLGizmoMeasure.cpp:2509
msgid "Length"
msgstr "長度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3879
msgid "Retraction Length (Toolchange)"
msgstr "回抽長度（更換工具時）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3880
msgid ""
"When retraction is triggered before changing tool, filament is pulled back "
"by the specified amount (the length is measured on raw filament, before it "
"enters the extruder)."
msgstr ""
"當在更換工具之前觸發回抽時，線材將被拉回指定的長度（長度是在原始線材進入擠出"
"機之前測量的）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3888
msgid "Ramping slope angle"
msgstr "斜坡角度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3889
msgid "Slope of the ramp in the initial phase of the travel."
msgstr "移動初始階段斜坡的坡度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3897
msgid "Use ramping lift"
msgstr "使用斜坡抬升"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3898
msgid ""
"Generates a ramping lift instead of lifting the extruder directly upwards. "
"The travel is split into two phases: the ramp and the standard horizontal "
"travel. This option helps reduce stringing."
msgstr ""
"產生斜坡抬升，而非直接向上抬升擠出機。移動分為兩個階段：斜坡與標準水平移動。"
"此選項有助於減少牽絲。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3905
msgid "Maximum ramping lift"
msgstr "最大斜坡抬升"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3906
msgid ""
"Maximum lift height of the ramping lift. It may not be reached if the next "
"position is close to the old one."
msgstr "斜坡抬升的最大抬升高度。若下一個位置與舊位置接近，則可能無法達到。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3915
msgid "Steeper ramp before obstacles"
msgstr "障礙物前的較陡斜坡"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3916
msgid ""
"If enabled, preFlight detects obstacles along the travel path and makes the "
"slope steeper in case an obstacle might be hit during the initial phase of "
"the travel."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，preFlight 會偵測移動路徑上的障礙物，並在移動初始階段可能撞到障礙物時"
"使坡度更陡。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3924
msgid ""
"High flow nozzles allow higher print speeds.\n"
"\n"
"Note: This value is controlled from Print Settings > Advanced > Tool "
"Configuration"
msgstr ""
"高流量噴嘴允許更高的列印速度。\n"
"\n"
"注意：此值由 列印設定 > 進階 > 工具設定 控制"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3930
msgid "Lift height"
msgstr "抬升高度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3931
msgid "Lift height applied before travel."
msgstr "移動前套用的抬升高度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3939
msgid "Above Z"
msgstr "將 Z 軸上昇"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3940
msgid "Only lift Z above"
msgstr "僅將 Z 軸往上昇起"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3941
msgid ""
"If you set this to a positive value, Z lift will only take place above the "
"specified absolute Z. You can tune this setting for skipping lift on the "
"first layers."
msgstr ""
"如果將此設定為正數，則 Z 軸上昇將只會出現在指定的 Z 軸。您可以調整此設定以跳"
"過第一層的昇高。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3948
msgid "Below Z"
msgstr "降低 Z 軸"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3949
msgid "Only lift Z below"
msgstr "僅將 Z 軸往下降低"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3950
msgid ""
"If you set this to a positive value, Z lift will only take place below the "
"specified absolute Z. You can tune this setting for limiting lift to the "
"first layers."
msgstr ""
"如果將此設定為正數，則 Z 軸上昇將出現在指定的絕對 Z 軸下方。您可以調整此設定"
"將上昇限制在第一層。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3958
msgid "Deretraction extra length"
msgstr "退抽額外長度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3959
msgid ""
"When the retraction is compensated after the travel move, the extruder will "
"push this additional amount of filament. This setting is rarely needed."
msgstr ""
"當行進移動後由回抽得到補償時，擠出機將推動額外長度的線材。不過很少需要做此設"
"定。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3966
msgid "Extra length on restart"
msgstr "重新啟動時的額外長度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3967
msgid ""
"When the retraction is compensated after changing tool, the extruder will "
"push this additional amount of filament."
msgstr "當更換工具後補償回抽時，擠出機將推動這一額外長度的線材。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3974
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3975
msgid "Retraction Speed"
msgstr "回抽速度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3976
msgid "The speed for retractions (it only applies to the extruder motor)."
msgstr "回抽速度（僅適用於擠出機馬達）。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3982
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3983
msgid "Deretraction Speed"
msgstr "擠回速度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3984
msgid ""
"The speed for loading of a filament into extruder after retraction (it only "
"applies to the extruder motor). If left to zero, the retraction speed is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"線材回抽後裝入擠出機的速度（僅適用於擠出機馬達）。如果保留為零，則使用回抽速"
"度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3991
msgid "Seam gap distance"
msgstr "接縫間隙距離"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:3992
msgid ""
"The distance between the endpoints of a closed loop perimeter. Positive "
"values will shorten and interrupt the loop slightly to reduce the seam. "
"Negative values will extend the loop, causing the endpoints to overlap "
"slightly. When percents are used, the distance is derived from the nozzle "
"diameter. Set to zero to disable this feature."
msgstr ""
"封閉迴圈輪廓兩端點之間的距離。正值會稍微縮短並中斷迴圈以減少接縫。負值會延伸"
"迴圈，使端點稍微重疊。使用百分比時，距離依噴嘴直徑推算。設為 0 可停用此功能。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4002
msgid "Seam position"
msgstr "接縫位置"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4004
msgid "Position of perimeters starting points."
msgstr "邊緣起點的位置。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4006
msgid "Nearest"
msgstr "最近的"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4006
#: src/DSKY/GUI/MainFrame.cpp:2026
msgid "Rear"
msgstr "後面"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4011
msgid "Staggered inner seams"
msgstr "交錯的內接縫"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4014
msgid ""
"This option causes the inner seams to be shifted backwards based on their "
"depth, forming a zigzag pattern."
msgstr "此選項會依內接縫的深度將其向後位移，形成鋸齒圖案。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4019
msgid "Seam type"
msgstr "接縫類型"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4021
msgid ""
"Controls how the seam point on external perimeters is shaped to hide start/"
"stop blobs.\n"
"\n"
"Regular - No seam shaping. Standard seam behavior.\n"
"\n"
"Nip/Tuck - Creates a V-shaped channel one perimeter deep at the seam. Both "
"the start and end of the external perimeter are pushed inward, and the first "
"inner perimeter is trimmed to absorb the disturbance.\n"
"\n"
"Nip - Only the start of the external perimeter is pushed inward at the seam. "
"The end remains on the normal path. The inner perimeter is trimmed on the "
"start side only.\n"
"\n"
"Tuck - Only the end of the external perimeter is pushed inward at the seam. "
"The start remains on the normal path. The inner perimeter is trimmed on the "
"end side only.\n"
"\n"
"Alt. Nip/Tuck - Alternates between Nip on even layers and Tuck on odd "
"layers. This distributes the seam disturbance across both sides of the "
"junction, preventing a consistent bulge on one side.\n"
"\n"
"Note: All non-Regular modes require multiple perimeters and are not used in "
"Spiral Vase mode."
msgstr ""
"控制外輪廓上的接縫點如何成形，以隱藏起始/停止的凸塊。\n"
"\n"
"Regular - 不進行接縫成形。標準接縫行為。\n"
"\n"
"Nip/Tuck - 在接縫處建立一道一輪廓深的 V 形通道。外輪廓的起點與終點都向內推，"
"第一道內輪廓被修整以吸收擾動。\n"
"\n"
"Nip - 接縫處僅外輪廓的起點向內推。終點維持在正常路徑上。內輪廓僅在起點側修"
"整。\n"
"\n"
"Tuck - 接縫處僅外輪廓的終點向內推。起點維持在正常路徑上。內輪廓僅在終點側修"
"整。\n"
"\n"
"Alt. Nip/Tuck - 在偶數層使用 Nip，奇數層使用 Tuck 交替。這將接縫擾動分散到接"
"點兩側，避免單側出現一致的凸起。\n"
"\n"
"注意：所有非 Regular 模式都需要多道輪廓，且不適用於螺旋花瓶模式。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4037
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4432
msgid "Regular"
msgstr "一般"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4038
msgid "Nip/Tuck"
msgstr "Nip/Tuck"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4039
msgid "Nip"
msgstr "Nip"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4040
msgid "Tuck"
msgstr "Tuck"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4041
msgid "Alt. Nip/Tuck"
msgstr "Alt. Nip/Tuck"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4044
msgid "Seam notch width"
msgstr "接縫缺口寬度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4046
msgid ""
"Width of the V-shaped notch as a multiple of the external perimeter "
"extrusion width. In Nip/Tuck mode, this is the full notch width across both "
"sides of the seam. In Nip or Tuck mode, only half the width is used since "
"only one side of the seam is shaped. The depth is automatically calculated "
"from perimeter spacing. Wider values are more forgiving for blobs but create "
"a larger surface depression. Narrower values are subtler."
msgstr ""
"V 形缺口的寬度，以外輪廓擠出寬度的倍數表示。在 Nip/Tuck 模式中，這是接縫兩側"
"的完整缺口寬度。在 Nip 或 Tuck 模式中，由於僅一側成形，只使用一半寬度。深度依"
"輪廓間距自動計算。較寬的值對凸塊較寬容，但會造成較大的表面凹陷。較窄的值則較"
"不明顯。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4052
msgid "x ext. width"
msgstr "x 外輪廓寬度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4061
msgid "Seam notch corner threshold"
msgstr "接縫缺口轉角閾值"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4064
msgid ""
"Controls where seam notching is applied based on corner sharpness. At sharp "
"corners the seam is naturally hidden by the geometry, so notching is "
"unnecessary.\n"
"\n"
"Seams on corners sharper than this angle are skipped. The default of 44° "
"means any corner of 44° or less is considered sharp enough to hide the seam "
"on its own - just under 45°, where a clean fold already conceals the "
"junction.\n"
"\n"
"Set to 0 to apply seam notching everywhere regardless of corner angle."
msgstr ""
"根據轉角銳利度控制套用接縫缺口的位置。在銳利的轉角處，接縫自然會被幾何隱藏，"
"因此不需缺口。\n"
"\n"
"比此角度更銳利的轉角上的接縫會被略過。預設值 44° 表示任何 44° 或更小的轉角都"
"被視為足夠銳利可自行隱藏接縫 - 略低於 45°，此時乾淨的摺角已能遮蔽接點。\n"
"\n"
"設為 0 則無論轉角角度為何，皆套用接縫缺口。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4078
msgid "Scarf joint placement"
msgstr "斜接接合位置"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4080
msgid "Where to place scarf joint seam."
msgstr "放置斜接接合接縫的位置。"

#. TRN: Drop-down option for 'Scarf joint placement' parameter.
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4085
msgid "Nowhere"
msgstr "無"

#. TRN: Drop-down option for 'Scarf joint placement' parameter.
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4087
msgid "Contours"
msgstr "輪廓"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4088
#: src/DSKY/GUI/FrequentlyChangedParameters.cpp:131
msgid "Everywhere"
msgstr "全部"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4091
msgid "Scarf joint only on smooth perimeters"
msgstr "僅在平滑輪廓上使用斜接接合"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4093
msgid "Only use the scarf joint when the perimeter is smooth."
msgstr "僅當輪廓平滑時才使用斜接接合。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4098
msgid "Scarf start height"
msgstr "斜接起始高度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4100
msgid ""
"Start height of the scarf joint specified as fraction of the current layer "
"height."
msgstr "斜接接合的起始高度，以目前層高的分數指定。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4108
msgid "Scarf joint around entire perimeter"
msgstr "斜接接合環繞整個輪廓"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4110
msgid "Extend the scarf around entire length of the perimeter."
msgstr "將斜接延伸至整個輪廓長度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4115
msgid "Scarf joint length"
msgstr "斜接接合長度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4117
msgid "Length of the scarf joint."
msgstr "斜接接合的長度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4124
msgid "Max scarf joint segment length"
msgstr "斜接接合段最大長度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4126
msgid "Maximum length of any scarf joint segment."
msgstr "任何斜接接合段的最大長度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4133
msgid "Scarf joint on inner perimeters"
msgstr "內輪廓上的斜接接合"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4135
msgid "Use scarf joint on inner perimeters."
msgstr "在內輪廓上使用斜接接合。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4140
msgid "Distance from brim/object"
msgstr "與帽邊/模型的距離"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4141
msgid ""
"Distance between skirt and brim (when draft shield is not used) or objects."
msgstr "裙邊與帽邊（在沒有使用防風罩時）或模型之間的距離。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4147
msgid "Skirt height"
msgstr "裙邊高度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4148
msgid "Height of skirt expressed in layers."
msgstr "裙邊的高度以層數表示。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4154
msgid "Draft shield"
msgstr "防風罩"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4156
msgid ""
"With draft shield active, the skirt will be printed skirt_distance from the "
"object, possibly intersecting brim.\n"
"Enabled = skirt is as tall as the highest printed object.\n"
"Limited = skirt is as tall as specified by skirt_height.\n"
"This is useful to protect an ABS or ASA print from warping and detaching "
"from print bed due to wind draft."
msgstr ""
"在防風罩啟用的情況下，裙邊將被打印為距離模型 skirt_distance，這可能會與邊緣相"
"交。\n"
"啟用 = 裙邊與最高的打印模型一樣高。\n"
"限制 = 裙邊與 skirt_height 指定的一樣高。\n"
"這有助於防止 ABS 或 ASA 這類材質的打印件因風力的冷卻而翹曲和從載台上分開。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4161
msgid "Limited"
msgstr "有限"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4166
msgid "Loops (minimum)"
msgstr "循環（最小）"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4167
msgid "Skirt Loops"
msgstr "裙邊循環"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4168
msgid ""
"Number of loops for the skirt. If the Minimum Extrusion Length option is "
"set, the number of loops might be greater than the one configured here. Set "
"this to zero to disable skirt completely."
msgstr ""
"外圍的圈數.如果設定了最小擠出長度，/,那麼圈數必須比這裏設定的值要大。設為0則"
"完全停用外圍."

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4176
msgid "Slow down if layer print time is below"
msgstr "如果單層打印時間低於這個設定值則降低速度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4177
msgid ""
"If layer print time is estimated below this number of seconds, print moves "
"speed will be scaled down to extend duration to this value."
msgstr ""
"如果單層打印時間估計低於此秒數，打印移動速度將按比例降低以將持續的時間延長至"
"此設定值。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4186
msgid "Don't slow down outer walls"
msgstr "不減慢外壁"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4187
msgid ""
"If enabled, outer wall speed will not be reduced to meet the minimum layer "
"time. This prevents wall thickness variation on thin-walled parts where the "
"cooling slowdown would otherwise cause over-extrusion at reduced speeds."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，外壁速度不會為了達到最小層時間而降低。這可防止在薄壁零件上因冷卻減速"
"而在降低速度時造成過度擠出，導致壁厚變化。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4194
msgid "Small perimeters"
msgstr "最小邊緣"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4196
msgid ""
"Speed for perimeters no larger than the small perimeter diameter (usually "
"holes). A percentage is recommended - it will be calculated as a percentage "
"of the perimeter speed, whether set manually or calculated by auto speed. "
"Set to zero to calculate it from the filament max volumetric flow."
msgstr ""
"邊緣不大於最小邊緣直徑（通常是孔洞）時使用的速度。建議使用百分比 - 無論是手動"
"設定還是由自動速度計算，都會依邊緣速度的百分比計算。設為零則依線材的最大體積"
"流量計算。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4207
msgid "Small perimeter diameter"
msgstr "最小邊緣直徑"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4209
msgid ""
"A perimeter no longer than the circumference of a circle of this diameter is "
"a small perimeter and prints at the small perimeter speed. Set to zero to "
"never apply the small perimeter speed."
msgstr ""
"周長不超過此直徑圓周長的邊緣即為最小邊緣，將以最小邊緣速度列印。設為零則永不"
"套用最小邊緣速度。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4217
msgid "Solid infill threshold area"
msgstr "實心填充上限區域"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4219
msgid ""
"Force solid infill for regions having a smaller area than the specified "
"threshold."
msgstr "為面積小於指定上限的區域強制作實體填充。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4220
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4674
msgid "mm²"
msgstr "mm²"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4226
msgid "Solid infill extruder"
msgstr "實體填充擠出機"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4228
msgid "The extruder to use when printing solid infill."
msgstr "打印實體填充時使用的擠出機。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4234
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5368
msgid "Solid infill every"
msgstr "實體填充每一個"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4236
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:5370
msgid ""
"This feature allows to force a solid layer every given number of layers. "
"Zero to disable. You can set this to any value (for example 9999); preFlight "
"will automatically choose the maximum possible number of layers to combine "
"according to nozzle diameter and layer height."
msgstr ""
"此功能允許在每個指定的層數上強制一個實體層。設為零表示禁用。您可以將其設定為"
"任意值（例如 9999）； preFlight 會根據噴嘴直徑和層高自動選擇最大可能的層數進"
"行組合。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4249
msgid ""
"Set this to a non-zero value to set a manual extrusion width for infill for "
"solid surfaces. If left zero, default extrusion width will be used if set, "
"otherwise 1.125 x nozzle diameter will be used. If expressed as percentage "
"(for example 90%) it will be computed over nozzle diameter or layer height, "
"depending on the 'Percentages relative to nozzle size' setting."
msgstr ""
"設為非零值可為實心表面填充手動設定擠出寬度。若維持 0，將使用預設擠出寬度（若"
"有設定），否則使用 1.125 倍噴嘴直徑。若以百分比表示（例如 90%），則依「百分比"
"相對於噴嘴尺寸」設定，以噴嘴直徑或層高計算。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4261
msgid ""
"Speed for printing solid regions (top/bottom/internal horizontal shells). "
"This can be expressed as a percentage (for example: 80%) over the default "
"infill speed above. Set to zero for auto."
msgstr ""
"打印實體區域（頂部/底部/內部水平殼）的速度。這可以表示為超過上述預設填充速度"
"的百分比（例如：80%）。設為零表示自動設定。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4272
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:44
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:47
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:101
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:104
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1198
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1202
msgid "Solid layers"
msgstr "實體層"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4273
msgid "Number of solid layers to generate on top and bottom surfaces."
msgstr "在頂面和底面生成的實體層數。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4279
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4280
msgid "Minimum thickness of a top / bottom shell"
msgstr "頂殼/底殼的最小厚度"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4286
msgid "Spiral vase"
msgstr "螺旋花瓶打印模式"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4287
msgid ""
"This feature will raise Z gradually while printing a single-walled object in "
"order to remove any visible seam. This option requires a single perimeter, "
"no infill, no top solid layers and no support material. You can still set "
"any number of bottom solid layers as well as skirt/brim loops. It won't work "
"when printing more than one single object."
msgstr ""
"此功能是在打印單面薄壁模型時逐漸升高 Z 軸，這樣可以去除任何可見的接縫。此選項"
"需要有單一邊緣、沒有填充、無頂部實體層和無支撐材料。您仍然可以設定任意數量的"
"底部純色層以及裙邊/帽邊。當打印多個模型時，這個設定將沒有作用。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4295
msgid "Temperature variation"
msgstr "溫度變化"

#. TRN PrintSettings : "Ooze prevention" > "Temperature variation"
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4297
msgid ""
"Temperature difference to be applied when an extruder is not active. The "
"value is not used when 'idle_temperature' in filament settings is defined."
msgstr ""
"擠出機未啟用時要套用的溫差。當線材設定中定義了 'idle_temperature' 時，不使用"
"此值。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4307
msgid "Emit temperature commands automatically"
msgstr "自動發出溫度指令"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4308
msgid ""
"When enabled, preFlight will check whether your custom Start G-Code contains "
"G-codes to set extruder, bed or chamber temperature (M104, M109, M140, M190, "
"M141 and M191). If so, the temperatures will not be emitted automatically so "
"you're free to customize the order of heating commands and other custom "
"actions. Note that you can use placeholder variables for all preFlight "
"settings, so you can put a \"M109 S[first_layer_temperature]\" command "
"wherever you want.\n"
"If your custom Start G-Code does NOT contain these G-codes, preFlight will "
"execute the Start G-Code after heated chamber was set to its temperature, "
"bed reached its target temperature and extruder just started heating.\n"
"\n"
"When disabled, preFlight will NOT emit commands to heat up extruder, bed or "
"chamber, leaving all to Custom Start G-Code."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，preFlight 會檢查您的自訂起始 G-Code 是否含有設定擠出機、熱床或腔體溫"
"度的 G-code（M104、M109、M140、M190、M141 及 M191）。若有，則不會自動發出這些"
"溫度，讓您能自由自訂加熱指令的順序與其他自訂動作。注意：您可以對所有 "
"preFlight 設定使用佔位變數，因此可將 \"M109 S[first_layer_temperature]\" 指令"
"放在任何想要的位置。\n"
"若您的自訂起始 G-Code 不含這些 G-code，preFlight 會在加熱腔體設至其溫度、熱床"
"達到目標溫度且擠出機剛開始加熱後，執行起始 G-Code。\n"
"\n"
"停用時，preFlight 不會發出加熱擠出機、熱床或腔體的指令，全部交由自訂起始 G-"
"Code 處理。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4323
msgid "Custom printer parameters"
msgstr "自訂印表機參數"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4332
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4351
#: src/luminary/gcode/emit/GCode.cpp:611
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:915
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:969
msgid "Start G-code"
msgstr "啟動 G-code"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4333
msgid ""
"This start procedure is inserted at the beginning, possibly prepended by "
"temperature-changing commands. See 'autoemit_temperature_commands'."
msgstr ""
"此起始程序會插入於開頭，可能前置溫度變更指令。請參閱 "
"'autoemit_temperature_commands'。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4342
msgid "Custom filament parameters"
msgstr "自訂線材參數"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4352
msgid ""
"This start procedure is inserted at the beginning, after any printer start "
"gcode (and after any toolchange to this filament in case of multi-material "
"printers). This is used to override settings for a specific filament. If "
"preFlight detects M104, M109, M140 or M190 in your custom codes, such "
"commands will not be prepended automatically so you're free to customize the "
"order of heating commands and other custom actions. Note that you can use "
"placeholder variables for all preFlight settings, so you can put a \"M109 "
"S[first_layer_temperature]\" command wherever you want. If you have multiple "
"extruders, the gcode is processed in extruder order."
msgstr ""
"這個程序在開始啟動時插入，在任何打印機啟動 gcode 之後（在多材料打印機的情況"
"下，在對該線材進行任何工具更改之後）。這用於覆寫特定線材的設定。如果 "
"preFlight 在您的自定義代碼中檢測到 M104、M109、M140 或 M190，這些命令將不會自"
"動添加到前面，因此您可以自由自定義加熱命令和其他自定義操作的順序。請注意，您"
"可以為所有 preFlight 設定使用佔位符號變數，也因此您可以在任何需要的地方放"
"置“M109 S[first_layer_temperature]”這個命令。若您有多個擠出機，則 gcode 按擠"
"出機順序處理。"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4368
msgid "Color change G-code"
msgstr "顏色變更 G-code"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4369
msgid "This G-code will be used as a code for the color change"
msgstr "此 G-code將用作顏色更改的代碼"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4377
#: src/luminary/gcode/emit/GCode.cpp:625
#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:986
msgid "Pause Print G-code"
msgstr "暫停打印 G-code"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:4378
msgid "This G-code will be used as a code for the pause print"
msgstr "此 G-code碼將用作暫停打印的代碼"

