#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1199
msgid ""
"Number of solid layers to generate on top and bottom surfaces. These layers "
"provide a finished appearance and structural support for the printed object."
msgstr "在頂面與底面產生的實心層數。這些層提供完工外觀與列印物件的結構支撐。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1201
msgid ""
"Minimum thickness (in mm) of top and bottom shells. The layer count will be "
"automatically increased if needed to meet this thickness, which helps "
"prevent pillowing on top surfaces when using variable layer heights."
msgstr ""
"頂部與底部殼層的最小厚度（mm）。若有需要，層數會自動增加以達到此厚度，這有助"
"於在使用可變層高時防止頂面起皺。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1203
msgid ""
"Number of solid layers between interlocking perimeters and visible surfaces. "
"Ensures the interlocking pattern is fully hidden inside the object."
msgstr "互鎖輪廓與可見表面之間的實心層數。確保互鎖圖案完全隱藏在物件內部。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1400
msgid "Available with at least one perimeter."
msgstr "至少有一個邊緣時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1403
msgid ""
"Available with at least one perimeter and a seam type other than Regular."
msgstr "至少有一個邊緣，且接縫類型不為一般時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1406
msgid "Available when dynamic overhang speeds are enabled."
msgstr "啟用動態懸空速度後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1408
msgid "Available with a fill density above 0%."
msgstr "填充密度大於 0% 時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1411
msgid "Available with infill, when automatic infill combination is disabled."
msgstr "有填充，且自動填充合併已關閉時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1414
msgid "Available with infill, when automatic infill combination is enabled."
msgstr "有填充，且自動填充合併已開啟時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1417
msgid "Available with infill and a maximum infill anchor length above 0."
msgstr "有填充，且填充錨定的最大長度大於 0 時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1419
msgid "Available with top or bottom solid layers."
msgstr "有頂部或底部實心層時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1421
msgid "Available with infill or solid layers."
msgstr "有填充或實心層時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1423
msgid "Available when Narrow to Athena is enabled."
msgstr "啟用「窄區轉 Athena」後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1431
msgid ""
"Available with top solid layers and Ensure vertical shell thickness, without "
"spiral vase."
msgstr "有頂部實心層和「確保垂直殼層厚度」時可用（不使用螺旋花瓶模式）。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1439
msgid ""
"Available with bottom solid layers and Ensure vertical shell thickness, "
"without spiral vase."
msgstr "有底部實心層和「確保垂直殼層厚度」時可用（不使用螺旋花瓶模式）。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1441
msgid ""
"Disabled while Auto speed is active; it sets this speed from the maximum "
"print speed and the volumetric flow."
msgstr "自動速度啟用時不可用；自動速度會根據最大打印速度和體積流量計算此速度。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1444
msgid "Available with top solid layers, while Auto speed is not active."
msgstr "有頂部實心層，且自動速度未啟用時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1447
msgid ""
"Available with support material and interface layers, while Auto speed is "
"not active."
msgstr "有具有介面層的支撐材料，且自動速度未啟用時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1450
msgid "Available with a fuzzy skin noise type other than Classic."
msgstr "絨毛表面雜訊類型不為 Classic 時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1453
msgid "Available with the Perlin, Billow or Ridged fuzzy skin noise."
msgstr "使用 Perlin、Billow 或 Ridged 絨毛表面雜訊時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1456
msgid "Available with the Perlin or Billow fuzzy skin noise."
msgstr "使用 Perlin 或 Billow 絨毛表面雜訊時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1458
msgid "Disabled while Spiral vase is active."
msgstr "螺旋花瓶模式啟用時不可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1460
msgid "Available when Serpentine is enabled."
msgstr "啟用 Serpentine 後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1463
msgid "Available when Serpentine and relaxed spacing are enabled."
msgstr "啟用 Serpentine 和寬鬆間距後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1465
msgid "Available when Serpentine is enabled and relaxed spacing is disabled."
msgstr "啟用 Serpentine 且關閉寬鬆間距後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1468
msgid ""
"Available when Serpentine and its depth limit are enabled and relaxed "
"spacing is disabled."
msgstr "啟用 Serpentine 及其深度限制，且關閉寬鬆間距後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1471
msgid ""
"Available when Serpentine is enabled and relaxed spacing and the outer loop "
"are disabled; the outer loop aligns the ridges itself."
msgstr ""
"啟用 Serpentine，且關閉寬鬆間距和外表面迴圈後可用；外表面迴圈會自行對齊脊線。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1474
msgid "Available when interlocking perimeters are enabled."
msgstr "啟用互鎖輪廓後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1477
msgid "Available with a top surface flow reduction above 0%."
msgstr "頂面流量降低大於 0% 時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1479
msgid "Available with top solid layers."
msgstr "有頂部實心層時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1482
msgid ""
"Available with a default acceleration above 0; at 0 the firmware's "
"acceleration is left alone."
msgstr "預設加速度大於 0 時可用；為 0 時韌體的加速度保持不變。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1483
msgid "Available with at least one skirt loop."
msgstr "至少有一圈側裙時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1486
msgid ""
"Available with a skirt, while the draft shield is not enabled; an enabled "
"draft shield sets the height itself."
msgstr "有側裙，且防風罩未啟用時可用；啟用的防風罩會自行設定高度。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1489
msgid "Available when support material or a raft is enabled."
msgstr "啟用支撐材料或筏板後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1491
msgid ""
"Available when supports are generated automatically; painted supports carry "
"this in the paint."
msgstr "支撐自動產生時可用；已上色的支撐會在上色中攜帶此設定。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1498
msgid "Available with supports and a custom top contact Z distance."
msgstr "有支撐和自訂頂部接觸 Z 方向距離時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1505
msgid "Available with supports and a half-layer bottom contact Z distance."
msgstr "有支撐和半層底部接觸 Z 方向距離時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1507
msgid ""
"Available when support material is enabled or support enforcers are painted."
msgstr "啟用支撐材料或已上色支撐強制區後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1509
msgid "Available with support material and interface layers."
msgstr "有具有介面層的支撐材料時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1511
msgid "Available when support material, a raft or a skirt is enabled."
msgstr "啟用支撐材料、筏板或側裙後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1513
msgid "Available with raft layers and a top contact Z distance above 0."
msgstr "有筏板層和大於 0 的頂部接觸 Z 方向距離時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1514
msgid "Available with at least one raft layer."
msgstr "至少有一層筏板時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1516
msgid "Available when ironing is enabled."
msgstr "啟用熨平後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1518
msgid "Available when ooze prevention is enabled."
msgstr "啟用預防滲漏後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1520
msgid "Available when the wipe tower is enabled."
msgstr "啟用擦拭塔後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1523
msgid ""
"Disabled while Avoid crossing perimeters is active; the two are exclusive."
msgstr "「避免跨越邊緣」啟用時不可用；兩者互斥。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1526
msgid ""
"Disabled while Avoid crossing curled overhangs is active; the two are "
"exclusive."
msgstr "「避免穿越捲曲懸空」啟用時不可用；兩者互斥。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1529
msgid "Available when Avoid crossing perimeters is enabled."
msgstr "啟用「避免跨越邊緣」後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1532
msgid "Available with the Arachne or Athena perimeter generator."
msgstr "使用 Arachne 或 Athena 邊緣產生器時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1534
msgid ""
"Available with the Arachne perimeter generator; Athena keeps its widths "
"fixed."
msgstr "使用 Arachne 邊緣產生器時可用；Athena 會保持其寬度固定。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1536
msgid "Available with the Athena perimeter generator."
msgstr "使用 Athena 邊緣產生器時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1543
msgid ""
"Available with a scarf seam placement other than Nowhere, without spiral "
"vase."
msgstr "斜接接合位置不為無時可用（不使用螺旋花瓶模式）。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1545
msgid "Available when interlocking beams are enabled."
msgstr "啟用樑柱互鎖後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1547
msgid ""
"Disabled while interlocking beams are active; they replace the segmented "
"regions."
msgstr "樑柱互鎖啟用時不可用；它會取代分隔區域。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1550
msgid ""
"Available with a segmented region width above 0, while interlocking beams "
"are not active."
msgstr "分隔區域寬度大於 0，且樑柱互鎖未啟用時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1553
msgid ""
"Disabled while manual fan speeds are active; they set the fan per feature."
msgstr "手動風扇轉速啟用時不可用；它會依元素設定風扇。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1555
msgid "Available when automatic cooling is enabled."
msgstr "啟用自動冷卻後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1558
msgid ""
"Available when automatic cooling or the fan always on is enabled, while "
"manual fan speeds are not active."
msgstr "啟用自動冷卻或風扇常開，且手動風扇轉速未啟用時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1561
msgid "Available when manual fan speeds are enabled."
msgstr "啟用手動風扇轉速後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1564
msgid ""
"Available when dynamic fan speeds are enabled, while manual fan speeds are "
"not active."
msgstr "啟用動態風扇轉速，且手動風扇轉速未啟用時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1573
msgid ""
"Available when automatic cooling uses the Consistent surface slowdown logic."
msgstr "自動冷卻使用「一致表面」減速邏輯時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1576
msgid "Available when multitool ramming is enabled."
msgstr "啟用多刀頭回抽推擠後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1579
msgid "Available when pressure advance is enabled for this filament."
msgstr "為此線材啟用壓力提前後可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1582
msgid "Available with more than one extruder."
msgstr "有多於一個擠出機時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1584
msgid "Available with a Marlin firmware flavor."
msgstr "使用 Marlin 韌體類型時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1586
msgid ""
"Available when the machine limits are in use, for the time estimate or "
"emitted to G-code."
msgstr "使用中的機器限制用於時間估算或輸出到 G-code 時可用。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1588
msgid ""
"Available when the machine limits are in use, with a Marlin firmware flavor; "
"only Marlin has minimum feedrates."
msgstr ""
"使用中的機器限制為 Marlin 韌體類型時可用；只有 Marlin 具有最小進給速度。"

#: src/luminary/layer/settings_spec/SettingsSpec.cpp:1596
msgid ""
"Available when the machine limits are in use, with a firmware that has a "
"travel acceleration (Marlin 2, RepRapFirmware, Rapid)."
msgstr ""
"使用中的機器限制搭配具有移動加速度的韌體（Marlin 2、RepRapFirmware、Rapid）時"
