#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:531
msgid ""
"Draft shield is enabled but Skirt loops is 0, so no draft shield is printed."
msgstr "已啟用防風罩，但裙邊循環數為 0，因此不會列印防風罩。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:643
msgid "All objects are outside of the print volume."
msgstr "全部的模型都在打印機範圍外。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:646
msgid "The supplied settings will cause an empty print."
msgstr "提供的設定將導致空白的打印。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:686
msgid ""
"Auto speed requires every filament to have a Max volumetric flow set. Check "
"your Filament Settings."
msgstr "自動速度要求每種線材都設定最大體積流量。請檢查您的線材設定。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:698
msgid "Ironing speed cannot be 0. Set an explicit speed or disable ironing."
msgstr "熨燙速度不可為 0。請設定明確的速度或停用熨燙。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:705
msgid ""
"Avoid crossing perimeters option and avoid crossing curled overhangs option "
"cannot be both enabled together."
msgstr "避免穿越輪廓選項與避免穿越捲曲懸空選項無法同時啟用。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:715
msgid ""
"Only a single object may be printed at a time in Spiral Vase mode. Either "
"remove all but the last object, or enable sequential mode by "
"\"complete_objects\"."
msgstr ""
"在螺旋花瓶模式下一次只能打印一個模型。除非刪除除最後一個模型之外的所有模型，"
"或者經由“complete_objects”啟用順序模式。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:719
msgid ""
"The Spiral Vase option can only be used when printing single material "
"objects."
msgstr "螺旋花瓶選項只能在打印單一材質模型時使用。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:724
msgid ""
"With absolute extruder addressing, Spiral Vase mode does not taper its first "
"and last layer and does not blend layers in XY. Enable \"Use relative E "
"distances\" in Printer Settings to get both, if your firmware supports it."
msgstr ""
"在使用絕對擠出機定址時，螺旋花瓶打印模式不會對第一層和最後一層進行錐化處理，"
"也不會在 XY 方向混合圖層。如果您的韌體支援，請在印表機設定中啟用\"使用相對於 "
"E 方向的距離\"以同時獲得這兩種效果。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:730
msgid ""
"Machine limits cannot be emitted to G-Code when Klipper firmware flavor is "
"used. Change the value of machine_limits_usage."
msgstr ""
"使用 Klipper 韌體類型時，機器限制無法輸出至 G-code。請變更 "
"machine_limits_usage 的值。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:766
#, boost-format
msgid ""
"While the object %1% itself fits the build volume, it exceeds the maximum "
"build volume height because of material shrinkage compensation."
msgstr ""
"物件 %1% 本身可放入成型空間，但因材料收縮補償的緣故，超出了最大成型空間高度。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:772
#, boost-format
msgid "The object %1% exceeds the maximum build volume height."
msgstr "物件 %1% 超出了最大成型空間高度。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:780
#, boost-format
msgid ""
"While the object %1% itself fits the build volume, its last layer exceeds "
"the maximum build volume height."
msgstr "物件 %1% 本身可放入成型空間，但其最後一層超出了最大成型空間高度。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:784
msgid ""
"You might want to reduce the size of your model or change current print "
"settings and retry."
msgstr "您可以縮小模型尺寸或變更目前的列印設定後再試一次。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:836
#, boost-format
msgid ""
"Variable layer height regions thicker than %1% mm are not supported with the "
"current support settings."
msgstr "厚度超過 %1% mm 的可變層高區域在目前的支撐設定下不受支援。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:861
msgid ""
"The wipe tower is only supported if all extruders use filaments of the same "
"diameter."
msgstr "僅當所有擠出機使用相同直徑的線材時才支援擦拭塔。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:870
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is currently only supported for the oozeBot Rapid, Marlin, "
"Klipper, RepRap/Sprinter, RepRapFirmware and Repetier G-code flavors."
msgstr ""
"擦拭塔目前僅支援 oozeBot Rapid、Marlin、Klipper、RepRap/Sprinter、"
"RepRapFirmware 及 Repetier G-code 類型。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:873
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is currently only supported with the relative extruder "
"addressing (use_relative_e_distances=1)."
msgstr "擦拭塔目前僅支援相對擠出機定址 (use_relative_e_distances=1)。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:876
msgid ""
"Ooze prevention is only supported with the wipe tower when "
"'single_extruder_multi_material' is off."
msgstr ""
"僅當 'single_extruder_multi_material' 關閉時，才支援搭配擦拭塔的防滲漏功能。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:878
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower currently does not support volumetric E (use_volumetric_e=0)."
msgstr "擦拭塔目前不支援容積率 E (use_volumetric_e=0)。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:880
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is currently not supported for multimaterial sequential "
"prints."
msgstr "多材料順序打印目前不支援擦拭塔。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:894
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is not supported when supports are combined with variable "
"layer height."
msgstr "當支撐與可變層高結合使用時，不支援擦拭塔。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:908
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is only supported for multiple objects if they have equal "
"layer heights"
msgstr "只有在多個模型具有相同的層高時才支援擦拭塔"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:911
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is only supported for multiple objects if they are printed "
"over an equal number of raft layers"
msgstr "如果有多個模型打印在相同數量的筏板上，擦拭塔僅支援多個模型"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:915
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is only supported for multiple objects if they are printed "
"with the same support_material_contact_distance"
msgstr ""
"只有使用相同的 support_material_contact_distance 打印的多個模型才支援擦拭塔"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:917
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower is only supported for multiple objects if they are sliced "
"equally."
msgstr "擦拭塔僅支援多個模型，但他們需要平均切片。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:950
msgid ""
"The Wipe tower is only supported if all objects have the same variable layer "
"height"
msgstr "只有在所有模型具有相同的可變層高度時才支援擦拭塔"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:984
#, boost-format
msgid "%1%=%2% mm is too low to be printable at a layer height %3% mm"
msgstr "%1%=%2% mm太低，無法在層高 %3% mm 處打印"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:991
#, boost-format
msgid "Excessive %1%=%2% mm to be printable with a nozzle diameter %3% mm"
msgstr "過大的 %1%=%2% mm 可打印噴嘴直徑為 %3% mm"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:1023
#: src/DSKY/GUI/ConfigManipulation.cpp:690
msgid ""
"The Wipe Tower currently supports the non-soluble supports only if they are "
"printed with the current extruder without triggering a tool change. (both "
"support_material_extruder and support_material_interface_extruder need to be "
"set to 0)."
msgstr ""
"擦拭塔目前僅支援非溶劑支撐\n"
"若它們是使用目前擠出機打印而不是觸發變更噴嘴的打印方式。"
"（support_material_extruder 和 support_material_interface_extruder 兩者都必須"
"設訂為 0）。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:1044
msgid ""
"Organic support tree tip diameter must not be smaller than support material "
"extrusion width."
msgstr "有機支撐樹尖端直徑不可小於支撐材料擠出寬度。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:1047
msgid ""
"Organic support branch diameter must not be smaller than 2x support material "
"extrusion width."
msgstr "有機支撐分支直徑不可小於 2 倍支撐材料擠出寬度。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:1049
msgid ""
"Organic support branch diameter must not be smaller than support tree tip "
"diameter."
msgstr "有機支撐分支直徑不可小於支撐樹尖端直徑。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:1054
msgid ""
"Baobab support trunk diameter must not be smaller than 2x support material "
"extrusion width."
msgstr "波巴布支撐樹幹直徑不可小於 2 倍支撐材料擠出寬度。"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:1095
msgid "First layer height can't be greater than nozzle diameter"
msgstr "不能大於噴嘴直徑"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:1100
msgid "Layer height can't be greater than nozzle diameter"
msgstr "第一層高度不能大於噴嘴直徑"

#: src/luminary/pipeline/print/Print.cpp:1134
msgid ""
"Relative extruder addressing requires resetting the extruder position at "
"each layer to prevent loss of floating point accuracy. Add \"G92 E0\" to "
"layer_gcode."
msgstr ""
"相對擠出機定址需要在每一層重置擠出機位置，以防止浮點精度損失。請將“G92 E0”添"
"加到 layer_gcode。"

