msgid ""
"Serpentine prints each region as a single continuous extrusion in place of "
"perimeters and infill, overriding most other print settings (perimeters, "
"fill density, fill pattern and related options). With a depth limit set, the "
"serpentine is confined to a band along the walls and the interior is filled "
"with normal infill.\n"
"\n"
"Enable Serpentine?"
msgstr ""
"蛇形會將每個區域列印為單條連續擠出，取代邊緣與填充，並覆蓋大多數其他列印設定"
"（邊緣、填充密度、填充花紋及相關選項）。設定深度限制後，蛇形會被限制在沿壁一"
"圈的帶狀區域內，內部則採用普通填充。\n"
"\n"
"是否啟用蛇形？"

