msgid "If enabled, sets preFlight as default application to open .stl files."
msgstr "如果啟用，preFlight 將成為打開stl檔的預設應用程式。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:477
msgid "Suppress \" - default - \" presets"
msgstr "停用 \"-預設-\" 指定"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:478
msgid ""
"Suppress \" - default - \" presets in the Print / Filament / Printer "
"selections once there are any other valid presets available."
msgstr ""
"一旦有任何可用的有效預設，請在打印/線材/打印機選擇中 停用 \"-預設-\" 指定。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:481
msgid "Show incompatible print presets"
msgstr "顯示不相容的打印預設"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:482
msgid ""
"When checked, the print presets are shown in the preset editor even if they "
"are marked as incompatible with the active printer"
msgstr ""
"選中後，打印預設會顯示在預設編輯器中，即使它們被標記為與當前打印機不相容"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:489
msgid "Show load project dialog"
msgstr "顯示載入專案對話框"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:490
msgid ""
"When checked, whenever dragging and dropping a project file on the "
"application or open it from a browser, shows a dialog asking to select the "
"action to take on the file to load."
msgstr ""
"勾選後，每當將專案檔案拖放至應用程式或自瀏覽器開啟時，會顯示對話框詢問要對載"
"入的檔案採取何種動作。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:497 src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:501
msgid "Allow just a single preFlight instance"
msgstr "只允許一個 preFlight 執行實例"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:498
msgid ""
"On OSX there is always only one instance of app running by default. However "
"it is allowed to run multiple instances of same app from the command line. "
"In such case this settings will allow only one instance."
msgstr ""
"在 OSX 上，預設情況下總是只有一個應用程式實例在運行。但是卻允許從命令視窗執行"
"同一應用程式的多個實例。當您設定了這個設定後將只允許一個實例執行。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:502
msgid ""
"If this is enabled, when starting preFlight and another instance of the same "
"preFlight is already running, that instance will be reactivated instead."
msgstr ""
"如果啟用了此功能，則當啟動了 preFlight 且同一 preFlight 的另一個實例已在執行"
"時，該實例將被重新啟動。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:510
msgid ""
"Always ask for unsaved changes in project, when: \n"
"- Closing preFlight,\n"
"- Loading or creating a new project"
msgstr ""
"在以下情況下，總是詢問項目中未儲存的變更：\n"
"- 關閉 preFlight，\n"
"- 匯入或建立新項目"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:519 src/DSKY/GUI/UnsavedChangesDialog.cpp:1039
msgid ""
"Ask to save unsaved changes in presets when closing the application or when "
"loading a new project"
msgstr "關閉應用程式或匯入新項目時要求儲存未儲存的預設變更"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:520
msgid ""
"Always ask for unsaved changes in presets, when: \n"
"- Closing preFlight while some presets are modified,\n"
"- Loading a new project while some presets are modified"
msgstr ""
"在以下情況下，始終要求對預設進行未儲存的變更：\n"
"- 在修改某些預設時關閉 preFlight，\n"
"- 在修改某些預設時匯入新項目"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:527 src/DSKY/GUI/UnsavedChangesDialog.cpp:1038
msgid "Ask for unsaved changes in presets when selecting new preset"
msgstr "選擇新預設時詢問預設中未儲存的變更"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:528
msgid ""
"Always ask for unsaved changes in presets when selecting new preset or "
"resetting a preset"
msgstr "選擇新預設或重置預設時，始終詢問未儲存的預設變更"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:532 src/DSKY/GUI/UnsavedChangesDialog.cpp:1036
msgid "Ask for unsaved changes in presets when creating new project"
msgstr "建立新項目時詢問預設中未儲存的變更"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:533
msgid "Always ask for unsaved changes in presets when creating new project"
msgstr "建立新項目時始終詢問未儲存的預設變更"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:540
msgid "Associate .gcode files to preFlight G-code Viewer"
msgstr "將 .gcode 檔案關聯到 preFlight 的 G-code 檢視器"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:541
msgid ""
"If enabled, sets preFlight G-code Viewer as default application to "
"open .gcode files."
msgstr ""
"如果啟用，將以 preFlight 的 G-code 檢視器設定為打開 .gcode 檔案的預設應用程"
"式。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:544
msgid "Associate .bgcode files to preFlight G-code Viewer"
msgstr "將 .bgcode 檔案關聯至 preFlight G-code 檢視器"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:545
msgid ""
"If enabled, sets preFlight G-code Viewer as default application to "
"open .bgcode files."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，將 preFlight G-code 檢視器設為開啟 .bgcode 檔案的預設應用程式。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:551
msgid "Use Retina resolution for the 3D scene"
msgstr "對 3D 場景使用 Retina 解析度"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:552
msgid ""
"If enabled, the 3D scene will be rendered in Retina resolution. If you are "
"experiencing 3D performance problems, disabling this option may help."
msgstr ""
"如果啟用此功能，3D 場景將以 Retina 解析度呈現。如果您遇到 3D 性能問題，禁用此"
"選項可能會有所幫助。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:562
msgid "If enabled, preFlight will be open at the position it was closed"
msgstr "如果啟用，preFlight 將在上一次關閉時的位置打開"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:567
msgid "Clear Undo / Redo stack on new project"
msgstr "清除新項目上的取消/重做堆疊"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:568
msgid ""
"Clear Undo / Redo stack on new project or when an existing project is loaded."
msgstr "清除新項目或匯入現有項目時的取消/重做堆疊。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:572
msgid "Enable support for legacy 3DConnexion devices"
msgstr "啟用傳統 3DConnexion 設備的支援"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:573
msgid ""
"If enabled, the legacy 3DConnexion devices settings dialog is available by "
"pressing CTRL+M"
msgstr "如果啟用這個，則按下 CTRL+M 可以打開舊版 3DConnexion 設備的設定對話框"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:580
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "相機"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:606
msgid "Use perspective camera"
msgstr "使用透視相機"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:607
msgid ""
"If enabled, use perspective camera. If not enabled, use orthographic camera."
msgstr "如果啟用，則使用透視相機。若未啟用，則使用正交相機。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:610
msgid "Use free camera"
msgstr "使用自由相機"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:611
msgid "If enabled, use free camera. If not enabled, use constrained camera."
msgstr "如果啟用，則使用自由相機。若未啟用，則使用受限相機。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:614
msgid "Reverse direction of zoom with mouse wheel"
msgstr "使用滑鼠滾輪反向縮放"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:615
msgid "If enabled, reverses the direction of zoom with mouse wheel"
msgstr "如果啟用，則滑鼠滾輪反向縮放"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:626
msgid "Mouse navigation"
msgstr "滑鼠導覽"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:627
msgid ""
"Selects which mouse buttons orbit and pan the 3D view, matching the "
"conventions of other applications. Wheel zoom, left-click selection and "
"Alt+Middle click pivot centering work the same in every scheme; outside the "
"default scheme the left button only selects, as in the scheme's namesake "
"application. Takes effect immediately."
msgstr ""
"選擇哪些滑鼠按鍵用於旋轉和平移 3D 檢視，並符合其他應用程式的操作慣例。滾輪縮"
"放、左鍵點擊選取，以及 Alt+中鍵點擊使旋轉中心置中，這些操作在所有方案中皆相"
"同；在預設方案以外，左鍵僅用於選取，其行為與該方案同名的應用程式一致。設定會"
"立即生效。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:633
msgid "preFlight (default)"
msgstr "preFlight（預設）"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:634
msgid "Blender"
msgstr "Blender"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:635
msgid "Fusion 360"
msgstr "Fusion 360"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:636
msgid "SolidWorks"
msgstr "SolidWorks"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:637
msgid "Tinkercad"
msgstr "Tinkercad"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:643
msgid "GUI"
msgstr "GUI"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:687
msgid "Legacy sidebar layout"
msgstr "側邊欄的舊版配置"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:688
msgid ""
"If enabled, the sidebar moves to the right: in Prepare the gizmo toolbar "
"moves to the left, and in the Preview the legend and the sidebar sit on the "
"right with the layer slider on the left. This matches the traditional slicer "
"layout. Requires application restart."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，側邊欄會移至右側：在準備檢視中，Gizmo 工具列移至左側；在預覽中，圖例"
"和側邊欄位於右側，打印層滑塊位於左側。這符合傳統切片器配置。需要重新啟動應用"
"程式。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:698
msgid "Order object volumes by types"
msgstr "按類型排列模型體積"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:699
msgid ""
"If enabled, volumes will be always ordered inside the object. Correct order "
"is Model Part, Negative Volume, Modifier, Support Blocker and Support "
"Enforcer. If disabled, you can reorder Model Parts, Negative Volumes and "
"Modifiers. But one of the model parts have to be on the first place."
msgstr ""
"如果啟用這個，模型內總是以體積的大小排序。正確的順序是模型零件、挖空模型、修"
"改器、支撐阻斷器和支撐執行器。如果禁用，您可以重新排列模型零件、挖空模型和修"
"改器。但是其中一個模型零件必須放在第一位。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:703
msgid "Show non-manifold edges"
msgstr "顯示非流形邊"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:704
msgid "If enabled, shows non-manifold edges."
msgstr "啟用後，顯示非流形邊。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:707
msgid "Allow automatically color change"
msgstr "允許自動換色"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:708
msgid ""
"If enabled, related notification will be shown, when sliced object looks "
"like a logo or a sign."
msgstr "啟用後，當切片物件看起來像標誌或標牌時，會顯示相關通知。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:714
msgid "Open the printer web interface in the system browser"
msgstr "在系統瀏覽器中開啟印表機網頁介面"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:715
msgid ""
"If enabled, the printer tab opens the printer's web interface in your "
"default browser instead of showing it inside preFlight."
msgstr ""
"啟用後，印表機分頁會在預設瀏覽器中開啟印表機的網頁介面，而不是在 preFlight 內"
"顯示。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:737
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "主題"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:739
msgid ""
"Select the application color theme. \"Auto\" follows your operating system's "
"light/dark setting. Changing the theme restarts preFlight."
msgstr ""
"選擇應用程式色彩主題。\"自動\" 跟隨您作業系統的淺色/深色設定。變更主題會重新"
"啟動 preFlight。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:759
msgid "Notify about new releases"
msgstr "通知新的版本發佈"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:760
msgid ""
"You will be notified about new release after startup acordingly: All = "
"Regular release and alpha / beta releases. Release only = regular release."
msgstr ""
"啟用此選項後，您將在啟動後收到有關新版本的通知：全部 = 定期發佈版本和 "
"alpha / beta 版本。僅發佈版 = 定期發佈。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:763
msgid "Release only"
msgstr "僅發佈版"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:796
msgid "Use binary G-code when the printer supports it"
msgstr "印表機支援時使用二進位 G-code"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:797
msgid ""
"If the 'Supports binary G-code' option is enabled in Printer Settings, "
"checking this option will result in the export of G-code in binary format."
msgstr ""
"若印表機設定中啟用了「支援二進位 G-code」選項，勾選此選項將以二進位格式匯出 "
"G-code。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:809
msgid "Show STEP file import parameters"
msgstr "顯示 STEP 檔案匯入參數"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:810
msgid ""
"If enabled, preFlight will show a dialog with quality selection when "
"importing a STEP file."
msgstr "啟用後，preFlight 在匯入 STEP 檔案時會顯示含品質選擇的對話框。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:830
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "效能"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:956
msgid "Maximum slicing threads"
msgstr "最大切片執行緒"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:957
msgid ""
"Limits the number of parallel worker threads used during slicing. Auto uses "
"all available cores. Lower values trade slicing speed for stability on CPUs "
"that crash under heavy parallel load."
msgstr ""
"限制切片期間使用的平行工作執行緒數。自動會使用所有可用核心。較低的值以切片速"
"度換取在重度平行負載下會當機的 CPU 的穩定性。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:976
msgid "Prefer Performance cores"
msgstr "偏好效能核心"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:977
msgid "Prefer Performance cores (not available: no hybrid cores detected)"
msgstr "偏好效能核心（無法使用：未偵測到混合核心）"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:978
msgid ""
"On Intel hybrid CPUs (12th gen and later), restricts preFlight to the "
"Performance cores only. This can improve slicing speed by avoiding the "
"slower Efficient cores at parallel synchronization points, and also helps on "
"CPUs that crash under heavy mixed-core load."
msgstr ""
"在 Intel 混合 CPU（第 12 代及以後）上，將 preFlight 限制在僅使用效能核心。這"
"可在平行同步點避免較慢的效率核心，從而提升切片速度，也有助於在重度混合核心負"
"載下會當機的 CPU。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:997
msgid "Lighting quality"
msgstr "光照品質"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:998
msgid ""
"Controls per-pixel lighting on 3D models. Auto detects your GPU and picks "
"the best option. Enhanced uses Blinn-Phong shading with specular highlights "
"and rim lighting for a more realistic look. Basic uses flat Gouraud shading. "
"Full adds cast shadows, ambient occlusion and physically based shading; it "
"needs a capable GPU and is never selected automatically."
msgstr ""
"控制 3D 模型上的逐像素光照。自動會偵測您的 GPU 並選擇最佳選項。增強使用具有鏡"
"面高光和邊緣光的 Blinn-Phong 著色，呈現更逼真的效果。基本使用平面 Gouraud 著"
"色。完整會新增投射陰影、環境光遮蔽和基於物理的著色；需要高效能 GPU，且永遠不"
"會自動選擇。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1004 src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1023
msgid "Auto (detect GPU)"
msgstr "自動（偵測 GPU）"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1005
msgid "Basic"
msgstr "基本"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1006
msgid "Enhanced"
msgstr "增強"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1007
msgid "Full (shadows + AO)"
msgstr "完整（陰影 + AO）"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1018
msgid "Anti-aliasing (MSAA)"
msgstr "抗鋸齒（MSAA）"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1019
msgid ""
"Controls multi-sample anti-aliasing for smooth edges. Auto tries the highest "
"level your GPU supports. Higher values give smoother edges but use more GPU "
"memory. Requires application restart to take effect."
msgstr ""
"控制多重取樣抗鋸齒以平滑邊緣。自動會嘗試您 GPU 支援的最高等級。值越高，邊緣越"
"平滑，但使用越多 GPU 記憶體。需要重新啟動應用程式才能生效。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1024 src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1046
msgid "Off"
msgstr "關閉"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1025 src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1046
msgid "2x"
msgstr "2x"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1026
msgid "4x"
msgstr "4x"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1027
msgid "8x"
msgstr "8x"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1028
msgid "16x"
msgstr "16x"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1040
msgid "Supersampling (SSAA)"
msgstr "超取樣（SSAA）"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1041
msgid ""
"Renders the 3D scene at a higher resolution and downsamples it, reducing the "
"aliasing bands visible in dense G-code previews. Sharper than MSAA but "
"considerably more demanding; intended for powerful GPUs. While enabled it "
"supersedes MSAA for the scene. Takes effect immediately."
msgstr ""
"以更高解析度呈現 3D 場景後再縮小，減少密集 G-code 預覽中可見的鋸齒紋路。比 "
"MSAA 更清晰，但效能需求高得多，適合高效能 GPU。啟用時會取代該場景的 MSAA。設"
"定會立即生效。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1046
msgid "1.5x"
msgstr "1.5x"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1058
msgid "Preview Detail"
msgstr "預覽細節"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1059
msgid ""
"Controls how much detail is computed for the G-code preview on large prints. "
"Lower values reduce memory usage and speed up slicing at the cost of less "
"detailed preview data. Does not affect print output, G-code, or time "
"estimation."
msgstr ""
"控制大型列印件的 G-code 預覽計算多少細節。較低的值可減少記憶體用量並加快切"
"片，代價是預覽資料較不詳細。不影響列印輸出、G-code 或時間估算。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1065
msgid "1M segments (default)"
msgstr "100 萬段（預設）"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1067
msgid "1M segments"
msgstr "100 萬段"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1070
msgid "5M segments"
msgstr "500 萬段"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1073
msgid "10M segments"
msgstr "1000 萬段"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1075
msgid "10M segments (default)"
msgstr "1000 萬段（預設）"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1078
msgid "20M segments"
msgstr "2000 萬段"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1079
msgid "Full (no limit)"
msgstr "完整（無限制）"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1089
msgid "Disable NVIDIA OpenGL Threaded Optimization"
msgstr "停用 NVIDIA OpenGL 執行緒最佳化"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1090
msgid ""
"Writes a per-application NVIDIA driver profile for preFlight.exe that turns "
"off OpenGL Threaded Optimization. This is the other common cause of slicing "
"crashes on Windows. Takes effect on the next preFlight launch. Unchecking "
"restores the driver default."
msgstr ""
"為 preFlight.exe 寫入每個應用程式的 NVIDIA 驅動程式設定檔，關閉 OpenGL 執行緒"
"最佳化。這是 Windows 上切片當機的另一常見原因。在下次 preFlight 啟動時生效。"
"取消勾選會還原驅動程式預設值。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1103
msgid ""
"Only needed if preFlight crashes during slicing. NVIDIA's Threaded "
"Optimization can conflict with preFlight's parallel slicing engine.\n"
"\n"
"If the checkbox above does not fix the crash, apply it manually:\n"
"1. Open NVIDIA Control Panel.\n"
"2. Go to 3D Settings → Manage 3D Settings → Program Settings.\n"
"3. Select preFlight from the program list (click Add and browse to "
"preFlight.exe if missing).\n"
"4. Set Threaded Optimization to Off and click Apply.\n"
"5. Relaunch preFlight."
msgstr ""
"僅在 preFlight 切片期間當機時需要。NVIDIA 的執行緒最佳化可能與 preFlight 的平"
"行切片引擎衝突。\n"
"\n"
"若上方核取方塊無法修復當機，請手動套用：\n"
"1. 開啟 NVIDIA 控制面板。\n"
"2. 前往 3D 設定 → 管理 3D 設定 → 程式設定。\n"
"3. 從程式清單選擇 preFlight（若缺少，請點擊「新增」並瀏覽至 "
"preFlight.exe）。\n"
"4. 將執行緒最佳化設為關閉並點擊「套用」。\n"
"5. 重新啟動 preFlight。"

#: src/DSKY/GUI/Preferences.cpp:1209
msgid "Script category execution order:"
msgstr "腳本類別執行順序："

